1
00:00:02,080 --> 00:00:03,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you keep your partner updated?</font>

2
00:00:05,520 --> 00:00:06,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You do?</font>

3
00:00:06,520 --> 00:00:08,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you want to know their plans, too?</font>

4
00:00:09,960 --> 00:00:10,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I guess so.</font>

5
00:00:10,560 --> 00:00:12,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Like checking up on them?</font>

6
00:00:12,120 --> 00:00:12,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, not checking up.</font>

7
00:00:12,920 --> 00:00:13,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just every day,</font>

8
00:00:13,680 --> 00:00:15,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">morning, noon or night,</font>

9
00:00:15,240 --> 00:00:17,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">at least drop me a message.</font>

10
00:00:17,080 --> 00:00:18,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tell me what you're doing,</font>

11
00:00:18,920 --> 00:00:20,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">if you've eaten, that sort of thing.</font>

12
00:00:20,280 --> 00:00:21,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's what I'd prefer.</font>

13
00:00:21,960 --> 00:00:22,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But some guys</font>

14
00:00:22,800 --> 00:00:24,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">get tired of it after a while.</font>

15
00:00:24,280 --> 00:00:26,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's always the same things:</font>

16
00:00:26,240 --> 00:00:27,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">"Good morning. Good afternoon.</font>

17
00:00:27,880 --> 00:00:28,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here's what I'm doing.</font>

18
00:00:28,240 --> 00:00:29,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Good evening. Here's what I'm doing."</font>

19
00:00:29,560 --> 00:00:30,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Some people find it annoying.</font>

20
00:00:30,520 --> 00:00:31,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hi, guys.</font>

21
00:00:34,600 --> 00:00:35,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hi, guys.</font>

22
00:00:37,280 --> 00:00:38,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I do feel a little threatened.</font>

23
00:00:38,680 --> 00:00:41,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">After all, I wasn't her clear choice.</font>

24
00:00:41,960 --> 00:00:42,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've waited so long I'm not hungry.</font>

25
00:00:42,760 --> 00:00:43,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've had three bottles of water.</font>

26
00:00:43,880 --> 00:00:47,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Heads out]
Huang Siyang, go to the date zone.</font>

27
00:00:53,560 --> 00:00:56,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hello, guys.</font>

28
00:01:05,960 --> 00:01:06,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hello.</font>

29
00:01:10,840 --> 00:01:11,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hello.</font>

30
00:01:11,600 --> 00:01:12,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Didn't expect to see you here.</font>

31
00:01:15,520 --> 00:01:16,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I only brought one piece of gum.</font>

32
00:01:16,800 --> 00:01:18,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was going to give it to you.</font>

33
00:01:18,720 --> 00:01:19,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Oh well, then.</font>

34
00:01:20,960 --> 00:01:22,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Oh well, then.</font>

35
00:01:22,200 --> 00:01:23,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What about mine?</font>

36
00:01:23,240 --> 00:01:24,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">None left. Sorry.</font>

37
00:01:24,040 --> 00:01:24,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All gone.</font>

38
00:01:27,560 --> 00:01:28,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All right.</font>

39
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:28,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll leave, then.</font>

40
00:01:28,680 --> 00:01:29,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't go.</font>

41
00:01:31,080 --> 00:01:31,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Share the seat with me.</font>

42
00:01:31,960 --> 00:01:32,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

43
00:01:39,160 --> 00:01:39,800
