44
00:01:40,760 --> 00:01:41,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's enjoy the sea breeze.</font>

45
00:01:42,720 --> 00:01:45,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This isn't a reward. It's a punishment.</font>

46
00:01:45,520 --> 00:01:46,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How could</font>

47
00:01:46,120 --> 00:01:48,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">something like this even happen?</font>

48
00:01:48,120 --> 00:01:49,920
