49
00:01:49,920 --> 00:01:50,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you know?</font>

50
00:01:50,480 --> 00:01:53,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just wanted the ground to swallow me.</font>

51
00:01:53,000 --> 00:01:55,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It was so awkward.</font>

52
00:01:55,240 --> 00:01:57,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[#Love Wins All S2: Intense Moments]
We were having dinner on our date,</font>

53
00:01:57,800 --> 00:02:00,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and then Siyang joined us.</font>

54
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:02,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He even shared my chair!</font>

55
00:02:02,360 --> 00:02:03,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I never saw that coming.</font>

56
00:02:03,920 --> 00:02:04,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It was just absurd.</font>

57
