60
00:02:09,480 --> 00:02:11,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why don't we date and let her leave?</font>

61
00:02:11,160 --> 00:02:12,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I know you want to date me.</font>

62
00:02:12,760 --> 00:02:14,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I knew right away.</font>

63
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:15,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can have him.</font>

64
00:02:15,400 --> 00:02:16,120
