65
00:02:17,360 --> 00:02:18,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to get my best outfit ready tomorrow.</font>

66
00:02:18,880 --> 00:02:20,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm getting ready to leave the island.</font>

67
00:02:20,360 --> 00:02:21,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Really?</font>

68
00:02:21,080 --> 00:02:22,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've already told him.</font>

69
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:22,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why?</font>

70
00:02:23,640 --> 00:02:24,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm leaving the island.</font>

71
00:02:24,200 --> 00:02:25,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're leaving?</font>

72
00:02:25,160 --> 00:02:26,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Things look bad now, bro.</font>

73
00:02:30,080 --> 00:02:31,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I wish I hadn't won.</font>

74
00:02:32,440 --> 00:02:33,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Why did I even try?]
Survival's no help at all.</font>

75
00:02:39,520 --> 00:02:40,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm done trying to survive.</font>

76
00:02:46,840 --> 00:02:47,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Want something to eat,</font>

77
00:02:47,520 --> 00:02:47,960
