78
00:02:47,960 --> 00:02:49,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, thanks.</font>

79
00:02:49,200 --> 00:02:50,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just ate.</font>

80
00:02:50,600 --> 00:02:53,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You ate? Who did you eat with?</font>

81
00:02:53,240 --> 00:02:55,280
