<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It was so awkward for all three of us.</font>

88
00:03:10,880 --> 00:03:12,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It felt ice-cold.</font>

89
00:03:16,400 --> 00:03:17,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why don't we all have some food?</font>

90
00:03:18,840 --> 00:03:20,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's eat.</font>

91
00:03:20,600 --> 00:03:24,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're like my "mom" and "dad."</font>

92
00:03:28,000 --> 00:03:29,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here, let me get you some.</font>

93
00:03:32,480 --> 00:03:33,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're the best.</font>

94
00:03:42,560 --> 00:03:42,800
