95
00:03:42,800 --> 00:03:44,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">do you want my chair?</font>

96
00:03:44,280 --> 00:03:45,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, thanks.</font>

97
00:03:45,020 --> 00:03:45,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[The "puppy" refuses]</font>

98
00:03:47,360 --> 00:03:49,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You like sharing a seat, huh?</font>

99
00:03:49,560 --> 00:03:50,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I want to sit closer to him.</font>

100
