101
00:04:05,160 --> 00:04:06,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Lovely weather today.</font>

102
00:04:06,840 --> 00:04:07,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not bad.</font>

103
00:04:07,240 --> 00:04:08,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's nice now.</font>

104
00:04:08,640 --> 00:04:09,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And?</font>

105
00:04:09,920 --> 00:04:10,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A breeze, too.</font>

106
00:04:15,380 --> 00:04:18,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Nervous feet]</font>

107
00:04:20,000 --> 00:04:21,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you know</font>

108
00:04:21,440 --> 00:04:23,520
