109
00:04:23,520 --> 00:04:24,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Another elimination day?</font>

110
00:04:24,560 --> 00:04:25,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

111
00:04:25,440 --> 00:04:26,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qixi, Chinese Valentine's Day.</font>

112
00:04:26,360 --> 00:04:27,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right, Qixi.</font>

113
00:04:27,560 --> 00:04:28,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Oh, really?</font>

114
00:04:28,080 --> 00:04:28,800
