115
00:04:28,800 --> 00:04:30,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll be gone by then.</font>

116
00:04:32,240 --> 00:04:33,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why do you keep thinking</font>

117
00:04:33,320 --> 00:04:34,840
