119
00:04:36,320 --> 00:04:38,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just did the math.</font>

120
00:04:39,440 --> 00:04:40,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think I'm going home, bro.</font>

121
00:04:44,040 --> 00:04:45,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I worked it out.</font>

122
00:04:45,520 --> 00:04:46,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I looked at how the votes were split.</font>

123
00:04:48,120 --> 00:04:48,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think I'm going home.</font>

124
