<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No way.</font>

125
00:04:52,040 --> 00:04:52,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm at risk.</font>

126
00:04:59,160 --> 00:05:00,560
