130
00:05:04,880 --> 00:05:05,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">One last chance to shine.</font>

131
00:05:07,960 --> 00:05:09,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Isn't that your best outfit today?</font>

132
