138
00:05:25,320 --> 00:05:26,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What color is it?</font>

139
00:05:27,880 --> 00:05:29,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me think. I'll wear white.</font>

140
00:05:30,440 --> 00:05:32,480
