142
00:05:34,160 --> 00:05:34,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll return those, too.</font>

143
00:05:36,840 --> 00:05:37,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You really won't need them.</font>

144
00:05:39,680 --> 00:05:42,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Maybe there won't be much time</font>

145
00:05:42,000 --> 00:05:43,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">or many chances to wear them.</font>

146
00:05:43,160 --> 00:05:43,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't return them.</font>

147
00:05:43,840 --> 00:05:44,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Leave them for me.</font>

148
00:05:44,880 --> 00:05:45,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't return them.</font>

149
00:05:45,680 --> 00:05:46,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Leave them for me.</font>

150
00:05:46,740 --> 00:05:47,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Leave them for me]</font>

151
00:05:48,280 --> 00:05:49,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My feet are bigger.</font>

152
00:06:04,160 --> 00:06:05,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why don't we all have some food?</font>

153
