157
00:06:11,800 --> 00:06:12,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I thought it was a vegetable.</font>

158
00:06:12,440 --> 00:06:13,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sorry, my mistake.</font>

159
00:06:13,800 --> 00:06:14,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sorry.</font>

160
