162
00:06:15,920 --> 00:06:17,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You want to send me off, don't you?</font>

163
00:06:17,680 --> 00:06:19,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't even want you going back.</font>

164
00:06:19,080 --> 00:06:20,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't want you going back.</font>

165
00:06:21,480 --> 00:06:23,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've already overstayed my welcome?</font>

166
00:06:23,680 --> 00:06:24,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If they don't announce it tomorrow,</font>

167
00:06:24,400 --> 00:06:25,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll stay forever.</font>

168
00:06:25,160 --> 00:06:26,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stay forever, bro.</font>

169
00:06:38,160 --> 00:06:39,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Know who's feeling most awkward now?</font>

170
00:06:41,040 --> 00:06:42,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ally, I guess.</font>

171
00:06:42,280 --> 00:06:42,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ally.</font>

172
00:06:46,280 --> 00:06:46,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I feel like</font>

173
00:06:46,920 --> 00:06:48,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she wants the ground to swallow her.</font>

174
00:06:48,080 --> 00:06:48,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think it's fine.</font>

175
00:06:53,040 --> 00:06:54,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Siyang, have a bite.</font>

176
00:06:54,040 --> 00:06:55,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You haven't eaten anything, have you?</font>

177
00:06:57,280 --> 00:06:57,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have a bite.</font>

178
00:06:57,760 --> 00:06:58,480
