<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's over.</font>

539
00:17:58,680 --> 00:17:59,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Man, the look on your face</font>

540
00:17:59,880 --> 00:18:01,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">was just like mine at first.</font>

541
00:18:01,440 --> 00:18:02,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You went through the same thing?</font>

542
00:18:02,280 --> 00:18:02,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Pretty much.</font>

543
00:18:02,880 --> 00:18:04,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Such a bitter smile.</font>

544
00:18:04,040 --> 00:18:05,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I couldn't even smile.</font>

545
00:18:05,360 --> 00:18:06,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's sit down for a bit.</font>

546
00:18:06,200 --> 00:18:08,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go on a date together.</font>

547
00:18:08,280 --> 00:18:09,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take a break.</font>

548
00:18:09,480 --> 00:18:10,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Shall we sit over there?</font>

549
00:18:10,360 --> 00:18:10,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">On the edge of the flower bed.</font>

550
00:18:11,600 --> 00:18:12,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's enjoy</font>

551
00:18:12,200 --> 00:18:14,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the end of our journey of affection.</font>

552
00:18:16,280 --> 00:18:18,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They're sitting where I had my date,</font>

553
00:18:18,560 --> 00:18:19,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">comforting each other.</font>

554
00:18:19,720 --> 00:18:21,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can't take it.</font>

555
00:18:21,400 --> 00:18:22,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look.</font>

556
00:18:22,680 --> 00:18:24,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They're going over it all again.</font>

557
00:18:25,320 --> 00:18:25,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look at him.</font>

558
00:18:25,920 --> 00:18:26,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">After just a few words,</font>

559
00:18:26,800 --> 00:18:28,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I felt like I didn't have a chance.</font>

560
00:18:28,560 --> 00:18:30,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Matching crossed legs]
Because I could tell</font>

561
00:18:32,120 --> 00:18:32,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Annie</font>

562
00:18:32,520 --> 00:18:33,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">probably wasn't into me.</font>

563
00:18:33,720 --> 00:18:35,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Maybe she thinks I'm too young</font>

564
00:18:35,240 --> 00:18:36,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and a little corny.</font>

565
00:18:36,280 --> 00:18:37,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Too much of a joker.</font>

566
00:18:37,960 --> 00:18:40,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't be the funny guy, man.</font>

567
00:18:40,040 --> 00:18:41,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm done being the funny guy.</font>

568
00:18:44,360 --> 00:18:46,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Funny guys don't find love]
I'm done being the funny guy, man.</font>

569
00:18:46,480 --> 00:18:47,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She said, "Don't get mad</font>

570
00:18:47,920 --> 00:18:48,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">when you watch this back.</font>

571
00:18:48,640 --> 00:18:50,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I said you were a little corny."</font>

572
00:18:50,680 --> 00:18:51,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And I said...</font>

573
00:18:52,800 --> 00:18:54,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was smiling like this at first.</font>

574
00:18:54,540 --> 00:18:56,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[The vanishing smile]</font>

575
00:19:00,480 --> 00:19:01,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can change that.</font>

576
00:19:01,720 --> 00:19:03,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Over time, you can get her</font>

577
00:19:03,240 --> 00:19:04,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to see you differently, I think.</font>

578
00:19:04,680 --> 00:19:07,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, I believe in love at first sight.</font>

579
00:19:07,200 --> 00:19:09,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Love at first sight]
First impressions can't be changed.</font>

580
00:19:11,360 --> 00:19:12,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Man.</font>

581
00:19:12,040 --> 00:19:13,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay, we've both lost.</font>

582
00:19:13,320 --> 00:19:13,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We really have.</font>

583
00:19:13,840 --> 00:19:14,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We've lost.</font>

584
00:19:14,920 --> 00:19:16,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Brothers in misery]
We're a disgrace to Changsha.</font>

585
00:19:16,080 --> 00:19:17,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We've fallen.</font>

586
00:19:18,920 --> 00:19:19,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Both Changsha Twin Stars defeated]
We're a disgrace to Changsha.</font>

587
00:19:19,840 --> 00:19:20,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What a disgrace.</font>

588
00:19:23,200 --> 00:19:24,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So embarrassing.</font>

589
00:19:27,600 --> 00:19:28,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What a coincidence, huh?</font>

590
00:19:28,520 --> 00:19:29,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You know?</font>

591
00:19:29,680 --> 00:19:30,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When I saw your face,</font>

592
00:19:30,400 --> 00:19:31,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">like you'd tasted something awful,</font>

593
00:19:31,640 --> 00:19:31,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">man,</font>

594
00:19:31,840 --> 00:19:33,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I knew exactly how you felt.</font>

595
00:19:33,360 --> 00:19:34,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[One look tells the same sad story]
You know?</font>

596
00:19:35,520 --> 00:19:37,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We shouldn't have won that game.</font>

597
00:19:37,960 --> 00:19:39,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fine, I'm giving up.</font>

598
00:19:39,680 --> 00:19:40,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm giving up.</font>

599
00:19:40,360 --> 00:19:40,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll just play casually.</font>

600
00:19:40,960 --> 00:19:42,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm done playing.</font>

601
00:19:45,120 --> 00:19:46,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Life is hopeless.</font>

602
00:19:46,320 --> 00:19:46,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hopeless.</font>

603
00:19:46,880 --> 00:19:47,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It really is hopeless.</font>

604
00:19:47,800 --> 00:19:49,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hopeless. I get it now.</font>

605
00:19:49,720 --> 00:19:50,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I know that feeling.</font>

606
00:19:50,760 --> 00:19:54,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Change of plans]
I'm done. Today's plans are ruined.</font>

607
00:19:54,240 --> 00:19:55,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I guess I'll have to leave.</font>

608
00:19:55,200 --> 00:19:56,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Book of Answers is full of lies.</font>

609
00:19:56,720 --> 00:19:57,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll never trust it again.</font>

610
00:19:57,840 --> 00:19:58,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who?</font>

611
00:19:58,160 --> 00:19:58,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Book of Answers.</font>

612
00:19:58,740 --> 00:19:59,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[The Book of Answers has no answers]</font>

613
00:20:00,480 --> 00:20:01,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My plan today</font>

614
00:20:01,160 --> 00:20:02,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">was based on The Book of Answers.</font>

615
00:20:02,640 --> 00:20:03,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Book of Answers.</font>

616
00:20:05,320 --> 00:20:08,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I didn't ask who she picked.</font>

617
00:20:08,440 --> 00:20:10,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I said, I don't even have to guess.</font>

618
00:20:10,520 --> 00:20:12,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It definitely wasn't me.</font>

619
00:20:12,400 --> 00:20:13,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Out of the three of us,</font>

620
00:20:13,080 --> 00:20:14,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she must have picked Liang.</font>

621
00:20:22,000 --> 00:20:22,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm done being the funny guy.</font>

622
00:20:25,700 --> 00:20:29,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[The emptiness after a bitter laugh]</font>

623
00:20:29,240 --> 00:20:30,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm going to lie on the grass.</font>

624
00:20:33,760 --> 00:20:35,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's lie on the grass.</font>

625
00:20:36,360 --> 00:20:36,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Lie down for a bit.</font>

626
00:20:41,400 --> 00:20:42,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's look at the stars.</font>

627
00:20:43,760 --> 00:20:45,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The lights are too bright. I can't see.</font>

628
00:20:46,840 --> 00:20:48,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do we do?</font>

629
00:20:48,040 --> 00:20:48,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm so tired.</font>

630
00:20:50,440 --> 00:20:51,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I really can't take it anymore.</font>

631
00:20:52,600 --> 00:20:53,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm exhausted.</font>

632
00:20:56,080 --> 00:20:56,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I really can't go on.</font>

633
00:21:00,320 --> 00:21:01,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My fragile little heart</font>

634
00:21:01,520 --> 00:21:03,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">can't take a blow this big.</font>

635
00:21:03,840 --> 00:21:05,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Before that dinner,</font>

636
00:21:05,320 --> 00:21:06,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was so excited too.</font>

637
00:21:09,120 --> 00:21:11,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I even put cologne on you.</font>

638
00:21:11,080 --> 00:21:12,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We both sprayed it on.</font>

639
00:21:12,480 --> 00:21:13,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Really went all out.</font>

640
00:21:13,000 --> 00:21:15,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Seven or eight sprays at least, bro.</font>

641
00:21:18,960 --> 00:21:19,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Getting ready for that date,</font>

642
00:21:19,840 --> 00:21:21,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we tried at least 20 different things.</font>

643
00:21:26,760 --> 00:21:28,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I thought it'd be a normal date.</font>

644
00:21:28,560 --> 00:21:30,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We wore our best outfits.</font>

645
00:21:34,000 --> 00:21:36,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I thought Annie would pick you.</font>

646
00:21:36,560 --> 00:21:41,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your outfits matched so well.</font>

647
00:21:41,760 --> 00:21:45,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Forget it.</font>

648
00:21:45,120 --> 00:21:46,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Our stars have fallen.</font>

649
00:21:46,200 --> 00:21:47,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fallen.</font>

650
00:21:48,920 --> 00:21:50,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But honestly,</font>

651
00:21:50,280 --> 00:21:51,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">didn't I say we've got 11 days left?</font>

652
00:21:51,480 --> 00:21:52,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've still got a chance.</font>

653
00:21:52,360 --> 00:21:53,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can change her impression of you.</font>

654
00:21:53,880 --> 00:21:55,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A lot of the time,</font>

655
00:21:55,680 --> 00:21:56,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you can change someone's impression.</font>

656
00:21:56,960 --> 00:21:57,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't believe that now.</font>

657
00:21:57,640 --> 00:21:58,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Really.</font>

658
00:21:58,040 --> 00:21:58,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No way.</font>

659
00:21:59,760 --> 00:22:01,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You'll have another chance.</font>

660
00:22:01,120 --> 00:22:02,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What kind of guys does she like?</font>

661
00:22:02,240 --> 00:22:03,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did you ask her?</font>

662
00:22:03,760 --> 00:22:04,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

663
00:22:04,560 --> 00:22:06,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't know what type she likes,</font>

664
00:22:06,040 --> 00:22:08,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but I'm definitely not her type.</font>

665
00:22:14,640 --> 00:22:15,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I feel like I'm done for.</font>

666
00:22:15,400 --> 00:22:16,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's get up and walk around.</font>

667
00:22:20,640 --> 00:22:21,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can barely walk straight.</font>

668
00:22:23,000 --> 00:22:24,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go. I'll head back</font>

669
00:22:24,000 --> 00:22:26,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and recharge a little.</font>

670
00:22:26,240 --> 00:22:27,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hang out with everyone and recharge.</font>

671
00:22:32,520 --> 00:22:33,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Enjoy the little time we have left.</font>

672
00:22:36,020 --> 00:22:41,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Today's affection is like perfume:]
[Sweet hope, then bitter loneliness]</font>

673
00:22:44,760 --> 00:22:46,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Want to play a game with us?</font>

674
00:22:46,880 --> 00:22:48,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We've written some new game cards.</font>

675
00:22:48,120 --> 00:22:49,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come join us.</font>

676
00:22:50,880 --> 00:22:52,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ke'er and...</font>

677
00:22:52,400 --> 00:22:53,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She has a headache,</font>

678
00:22:53,120 --> 00:22:54,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so she wants to rest in her room.</font>

679
00:22:54,720 --> 00:22:55,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And so did Song.</font>

680
00:22:55,840 --> 00:22:57,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay, come on.</font>

681
00:22:58,080 --> 00:22:58,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come join us.</font>

682
00:22:59,600 --> 00:23:00,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">See if there's a seat anywhere.</font>

683
00:23:01,440 --> 00:23:02,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can sit there.</font>

684
00:23:03,620 --> 00:23:04,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Moves over without being asked]</font>

685
00:23:17,800 --> 00:23:18,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you sitting there?</font>

686
00:23:19,320 --> 00:23:19,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why don't you sit here?</font>

687
00:23:19,840 --> 00:23:20,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll sit on the inside.</font>

688
00:23:20,840 --> 00:23:21,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

689
00:23:23,360 --> 00:23:24,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Those two went on a date, right?</font>

690
00:23:24,580 --> 00:23:25,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[A little late to catch on]</font>

691
00:23:25,640 --> 00:23:26,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't.</font>

692
00:23:26,260 --> 00:23:27,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Must you tell the whole world?]</font>

693
00:23:35,440 --> 00:23:36,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go.</font>

694
00:23:37,720 --> 00:23:38,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's about to fall.</font>

695
00:23:38,800 --> 00:23:40,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Oh no, my hands are shaking today.</font>

696
00:23:40,480 --> 00:23:41,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's okay.</font>

697
00:23:41,640 --> 00:23:43,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's Truth or Dare. Why so scared?</font>

698
00:23:44,000 --> 00:23:45,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My hands are shaking.</font>

699
00:23:45,600 --> 00:23:46,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Careful.</font>

700
00:23:52,320 --> 00:23:53,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The first truth question.</font>

701
00:23:56,060 --> 00:23:57,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Deafened by that high-pitched squeal]</font>

702
00:23:57,880 --> 00:23:59,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's the question? Let's hear it.</font>

703
00:23:59,360 --> 00:24:00,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll help you.</font>

704
00:24:00,080 --> 00:24:02,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me take a look.</font>

705
00:24:02,040 --> 00:24:04,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Pick the guy you're most interested in.</font>

706
00:24:04,600 --> 00:24:07,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Dare: Everyone closes their eyes]
Pat him while everyone's eyes are shut.</font>

707
00:24:07,040 --> 00:24:08,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once everyone opens their eyes,
explain your choice.</font>

708
00:24:16,200 --> 00:24:16,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's close our eyes.</font>

709
00:24:16,960 --> 00:24:17,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Close our eyes.</font>

710
00:24:24,080 --> 00:24:25,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Should we make some noise?</font>

711
00:24:46,220 --> 00:24:48,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Claire Cai chooses Wang Sheng]</font>

712
00:24:50,440 --> 00:24:51,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Done.</font>

713
00:25:01,320 --> 00:25:03,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Because he's so...</font>

714
00:25:03,600 --> 00:25:04,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He seems so clean-cut.</font>

715
00:25:20,840 --> 00:25:21,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

716
00:25:25,160 --> 00:25:26,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I know what you mean.</font>

717
00:25:27,600 --> 00:25:28,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He does.</font>

718
00:25:42,760 --> 00:25:44,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How many girls are you interested in?</font>

719
00:25:45,480 --> 00:25:46,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">One.</font>

720
00:25:46,260 --> 00:25:47,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">One?</font>

721
00:25:48,160 --> 00:25:50,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Such affection!</font>

722
00:25:50,200 --> 00:25:51,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Love Wins All.</font>

723
00:25:53,160 --> 00:25:54,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Pick a girl to carry in your arms</font>

724
00:25:54,720 --> 00:25:55,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and do five squats.</font>

725
00:25:55,840 --> 00:25:56,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I pick Xinran.</font>

726
00:26:01,280 --> 00:26:01,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">See?</font>

727
00:26:01,760 --> 00:26:02,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">One.</font>

728
00:26:02,600 --> 00:26:04,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Two.</font>

729
00:26:04,240 --> 00:26:05,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Three.</font>

730
00:26:13,280 --> 00:26:14,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Five squats done in no time]
Four.</font>

731
00:26:14,240 --> 00:26:15,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Five.</font>

732
00:26:15,480 --> 00:26:16,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Six.</font>

733
00:26:16,800 --> 00:26:18,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why the extra reps? Just five.</font>

734
00:26:18,720 --> 00:26:20,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's fine.</font>

735
00:26:21,120 --> 00:26:22,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Can't bear to put her down]
Fifteen!</font>

736
00:26:22,240 --> 00:26:23,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He won't stop.</font>

737
00:26:23,560 --> 00:26:24,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A hundred and fifty!</font>

738
00:26:29,240 --> 00:26:30,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm going to the bathroom.</font>

739
00:26:30,480 --> 00:26:31,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll go with you.</font>

740
00:26:31,280 --> 00:26:32,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay, let's go.</font>

741
00:26:34,620 --> 00:26:38,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[The game continues]</font>

742
00:26:38,640 --> 00:26:39,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Draw a card first.</font>

743
00:26:39,440 --> 00:26:40,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay, I'll draw one.</font>

744
00:26:40,520 --> 00:26:41,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The one in the middle.</font>

745
00:26:44,160 --> 00:26:46,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go on a 20-minute private date</font>

746
00:26:46,840 --> 00:26:48,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">with the girl who loses next round.</font>

747
00:26:57,100 --> 00:27:00,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Ren Chunxi isn't back yet]</font>

748
00:27:00,800 --> 00:27:02,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Girls, don't lose on purpose.</font>

749
00:27:04,880 --> 00:27:06,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Should we wait for those two?</font>

750
00:27:08,440 --> 00:27:09,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It doesn't matter, does it?</font>

751
00:27:10,040 --> 00:27:10,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's just start without them.</font>

752
00:27:12,920 --> 00:27:13,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No need to wait.</font>

753
00:27:15,360 --> 00:27:16,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, we have to wait.</font>

754
00:27:16,760 --> 00:27:17,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, let's not.</font>

755
00:27:17,560 --> 00:27:18,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We have to wait.</font>

756
00:27:18,480 --> 00:27:19,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're really not waiting.</font>

757
00:27:19,160 --> 00:27:20,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We have to.</font>

758
00:27:24,040 --> 00:27:25,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Liu Xinran, Ren Chunxi]
Do you like Sheng?</font>

759
00:27:25,280 --> 00:27:26,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I didn't say I like him,</font>

760
00:27:26,280 --> 00:27:28,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but I'm most interested in him.</font>

761
00:27:28,240 --> 00:27:28,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can tell.</font>

762
00:27:30,200 --> 00:27:31,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is it that obvious?</font>

763
00:27:35,760 --> 00:27:36,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's wait for them.</font>

764
00:27:38,160 --> 00:27:39,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I know she likes him.</font>

765
00:27:39,120 --> 00:27:41,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's told me many times.</font>

766
00:27:41,440 --> 00:27:44,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I wanted to save this round for her.</font>

767
00:27:44,680 --> 00:27:46,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's wait a bit.</font>

768
00:27:49,520 --> 00:27:50,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Too many people are missing.</font>

769
00:27:50,400 --> 00:27:52,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I wanted everyone to join in.</font>

770
00:27:53,880 --> 00:27:55,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's just play another round.</font>

771
00:27:55,080 --> 00:27:55,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">While we wait,</font>

772
00:27:55,840 --> 00:27:57,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we can play a round that doesn't count.</font>

773
00:27:57,320 --> 00:27:59,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sure, this one won't count, then.</font>

774
00:28:00,320 --> 00:28:00,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

775
00:28:07,040 --> 00:28:08,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, this is just a normal round.</font>

776
00:28:08,760 --> 00:28:09,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">For a block in the middle,</font>

777
00:28:09,640 --> 00:28:10,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you can pinch it.</font>

778
00:28:10,920 --> 00:28:11,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Really?</font>

779
00:28:12,160 --> 00:28:14,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But if you want to lose, I can't help.</font>

780
00:28:14,400 --> 00:28:16,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This one doesn't count.</font>

781
00:28:16,440 --> 00:28:17,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This round doesn't count, right?</font>

782
00:28:17,200 --> 00:28:18,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right.</font>

783
00:28:19,600 --> 00:28:20,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's a shame.</font>

784
00:28:29,880 --> 00:28:30,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right here.</font>

785
00:28:30,360 --> 00:28:31,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Push it this way.</font>

786
00:28:32,600 --> 00:28:33,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The pressure's on.</font>

787
00:28:37,000 --> 00:28:38,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go on, draw a card.</font>

788
00:28:41,560 --> 00:28:43,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This one's not bad.</font>

789
00:28:43,960 --> 00:28:45,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All the guys close their eyes.</font>

790
00:28:45,360 --> 00:28:48,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Point to the guy here
you're most interested in.</font>

791
00:28:48,600 --> 00:28:49,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This one's not bad.</font>

792
00:28:56,860 --> 00:28:58,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Ren Chunxi returns]</font>

793
00:29:01,880 --> 00:29:02,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come here.</font>

794
00:29:02,440 --> 00:29:04,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">An exciting game is waiting for you.</font>

795
00:29:04,240 --> 00:29:06,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But I wasn't in that round.</font>

796
00:29:08,880 --> 00:29:11,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've been helping you all along.</font>

797
00:29:11,320 --> 00:29:12,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You'll see in a minute.</font>

798
00:29:12,560 --> 00:29:14,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll point to the guy
I'm most interested in.</font>

799
00:29:24,640 --> 00:29:27,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That really makes my heart flutter.</font>

800
00:29:27,200 --> 00:29:28,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So you wouldn't consider</font>

801
00:29:28,080 --> 00:29:29,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">any of the other girls?</font>

802
00:29:29,240 --> 00:29:30,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's right.</font>

803
00:29:42,420 --> 00:29:44,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Yuning's top choice: Wang Tianqing]</font>

804
00:29:52,520 --> 00:29:53,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay, all done.</font>

805
00:30:00,720 --> 00:30:01,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

806
00:30:01,120 --> 00:30:02,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's do the dare from the last round.</font>

807
00:30:02,920 --> 00:30:04,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Back to the previous round.</font>

808
00:30:04,480 --> 00:30:05,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">His last dare was to go on a date</font>

809
00:30:05,640 --> 00:30:07,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">with the girl who loses the next round.</font>

810
00:30:14,320 --> 00:30:16,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I told you we had to wait.</font>

811
00:30:23,760 --> 00:30:24,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Will this work?</font>

812
00:30:24,840 --> 00:30:25,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't know.</font>

813
00:30:25,440 --> 00:30:26,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This one works.</font>

814
00:30:26,000 --> 00:30:27,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I really can't figure it out.</font>

815
00:30:35,440 --> 00:30:37,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Girls, don't lose on purpose.</font>

816
00:31:08,420 --> 00:31:09,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Pushes it straight over]</font>

817
00:31:09,880 --> 00:31:10,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She did that on purpose.</font>

818
00:31:10,800 --> 00:31:12,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She knocked it over like this.</font>

819
00:31:21,400 --> 00:31:23,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Next time, invite me to...</font>

820
00:31:28,720 --> 00:31:29,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You guys keep playing.</font>

821
00:31:29,440 --> 00:31:30,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'll go have a chat.</font>

822
00:31:30,240 --> 00:31:31,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go.</font>

823
00:31:31,000 --> 00:31:32,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait, do this one too.</font>

824
00:31:32,520 --> 00:31:33,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Dare: Pin a guy to the wall for 10s]
One last thing.</font>

825
00:31:33,200 --> 00:31:34,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do the ten-second wall pin first.</font>

826
00:31:36,440 --> 00:31:37,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why me?</font>

827
00:31:38,240 --> 00:31:39,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Because you lost the round.</font>

828
00:31:39,440 --> 00:31:40,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That was his dare from the last round.</font>

829
00:31:43,120 --> 00:31:44,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks for doing this.</font>

830
00:31:47,280 --> 00:31:48,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Start with the wall pin.</font>

831
00:31:48,480 --> 00:31:49,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Set the mood.</font>

832
00:31:49,640 --> 00:31:50,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do the wall pin first.</font>

833
00:31:50,680 --> 00:31:51,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Set the mood.</font>

834
00:31:51,560 --> 00:31:52,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

835
00:31:54,320 --> 00:31:55,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm pinning him to the wall?</font>

836
00:31:55,160 --> 00:31:56,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Of course.</font>

837
00:31:56,760 --> 00:31:57,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ten seconds.</font>

838
00:31:57,720 --> 00:31:58,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Use both hands.</font>

839
00:31:58,680 --> 00:31:59,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look into each other's eyes.</font>

840
00:32:00,200 --> 00:32:00,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait.</font>

841
00:32:02,000 --> 00:32:02,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait.</font>

842
00:32:03,040 --> 00:32:04,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Coach Zheng]
We've even got a coach.</font>

843
00:32:10,360 --> 00:32:12,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Start.</font>

844
00:32:20,100 --> 00:32:22,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Filmed by Gao Yuheng]</font>

845
00:32:22,360 --> 00:32:23,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why are you</font>

846
00:32:23,280 --> 00:32:24,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">putting your hands up in surrender?</font>

847
00:32:34,720 --> 00:32:36,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ten seconds?</font>

848
00:32:36,600 --> 00:32:37,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ten seconds.</font>

849
00:32:51,480 --> 00:32:52,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Four.</font>

850
00:32:52,680 --> 00:32:53,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Three.</font>

851
00:32:53,920 --> 00:32:54,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Two.</font>

852
00:32:55,160 --> 00:32:55,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Two.</font>

853
00:32:56,320 --> 00:32:56,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">One.</font>

854
00:32:56,720 --> 00:32:57,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">One and a half.</font>

855
00:32:58,640 --> 00:32:59,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

856
00:32:59,480 --> 00:33:01,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Off you go.</font>

857
00:33:01,440 --> 00:33:02,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Congratulations.</font>

858
00:33:04,160 --> 00:33:05,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Isn't this way better than your dates?</font>

859
00:33:07,920 --> 00:33:08,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go.</font>

860
00:33:08,680 --> 00:33:09,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go outside and talk.</font>

861
00:33:10,700 --> 00:33:15,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[The brave get to enjoy life first]</font>

862
00:33:22,240 --> 00:33:24,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You looked so different this afternoon.</font>

863
00:33:25,200 --> 00:33:25,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What?</font>

864
00:33:25,800 --> 00:33:27,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You looked so different this afternoon.</font>

865
00:33:27,000 --> 00:33:28,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My look was different?</font>

866
00:33:28,400 --> 00:33:29,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

867
00:33:29,000 --> 00:33:30,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I actually wanted you to try</font>

868
00:33:30,280 --> 00:33:31,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">these glasses,</font>

869
00:33:31,440 --> 00:33:32,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but you've just tried them on.</font>

870
00:33:33,160 --> 00:33:33,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They're those...</font>

871
00:33:34,680 --> 00:33:36,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">nerdy glasses, right?</font>

872
00:33:41,920 --> 00:33:42,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's just chat.</font>

873
00:33:43,400 --> 00:33:44,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's find somewhere to sit.</font>

874
00:33:46,320 --> 00:33:47,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Because I feel like</font>

875
00:33:47,320 --> 00:33:49,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was always starting our chats today.</font>

876
00:33:49,440 --> 00:33:51,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't know how you feel...</font>

877
00:33:51,800 --> 00:33:52,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Really?</font>

878
00:33:52,240 --> 00:33:54,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes, so I felt like you weren't...</font>

879
00:33:54,760 --> 00:33:56,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When did you try talking to me?</font>

880
00:33:57,240 --> 00:33:58,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When did you try talking to me?</font>

881
00:33:58,720 --> 00:34:00,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Loading memories]
When we were cooking, for example.</font>

882
00:34:00,120 --> 00:34:01,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was the one talking to you.</font>

883
00:34:01,360 --> 00:34:03,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So I just didn't know...</font>

884
00:34:03,080 --> 00:34:05,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">At the time, I thought...</font>

885
00:34:05,480 --> 00:34:07,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You said you don't cook, so...</font>

886
00:34:08,280 --> 00:34:09,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Steps closer]
And you...</font>

887
00:34:09,560 --> 00:34:11,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Steps back]
You were looking for ways to help.</font>

888
00:34:11,160 --> 00:34:13,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You'd feel awkward doing nothing,</font>

889
00:34:13,640 --> 00:34:14,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Steps closer]
so I asked you to come over.</font>

890
00:34:14,520 --> 00:34:16,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Steps closer again]
Yeah, but you didn't talk to me.</font>

891
00:34:16,220 --> 00:34:17,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Keeps stepping closer]</font>

892
00:34:17,160 --> 00:34:18,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Steps back]
Didn't I tell you</font>

893
00:34:18,080 --> 00:34:19,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Keeps stepping back]
how to cut it?</font>

894
00:34:19,600 --> 00:34:20,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why do you take a step back</font>

895
00:34:20,280 --> 00:34:21,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">every time I step toward you?</font>

896
00:34:23,800 --> 00:34:24,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You mean right now?</font>

897
00:34:24,400 --> 00:34:25,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

898
00:34:25,600 --> 00:34:27,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll move a bit closer.</font>

899
00:34:27,120 --> 00:34:29,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Didn't I tell you how to cut it?</font>

900
00:34:29,840 --> 00:34:30,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right now...</font>

901
00:34:30,400 --> 00:34:31,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That counts as you making a move?</font>

902
00:34:35,860 --> 00:34:39,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[The "neighbors" peek at the drama]</font>

903
00:34:40,720 --> 00:34:41,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not a move. I just think...</font>

904
00:34:41,920 --> 00:34:43,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So you felt</font>

905
00:34:43,000 --> 00:34:44,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Steps closer again]
that was your response then?</font>

906
00:34:44,960 --> 00:34:45,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

907
00:34:45,880 --> 00:34:46,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It definitely wasn't making a move.</font>

908
00:34:46,720 --> 00:34:49,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I wasn't being cold, I just...</font>

909
00:34:49,880 --> 00:34:50,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's all.</font>

910
00:34:52,680 --> 00:34:53,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

911
00:34:53,680 --> 00:34:55,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Shall we find somewhere to sit, or...?</font>

912
00:34:55,680 --> 00:34:56,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Either is fine.</font>

913
00:34:56,120 --> 00:34:58,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Or we can go back. Whatever you want.</font>

914
00:34:58,240 --> 00:34:59,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's find a place to sit.</font>

915
00:34:59,120 --> 00:35:00,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We can sit here or over there.</font>

916
00:35:01,360 --> 00:35:02,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay, let's stay here for a while.</font>

917
00:35:07,680 --> 00:35:09,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yesterday...</font>

918
00:35:09,040 --> 00:35:09,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yesterday, I thought</font>

919
00:35:09,880 --> 00:35:11,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I might have to leave the island.</font>

920
00:35:12,280 --> 00:35:14,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then I thought,</font>

921
00:35:14,120 --> 00:35:16,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">if I ended up leaving</font>

922
00:35:16,600 --> 00:35:18,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">just because I wouldn't speak up</font>

923
00:35:18,120 --> 00:35:19,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">or make a move,</font>

924
00:35:21,840 --> 00:35:26,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Pillow presses her mic to her chest]
I'd feel I wasn't man enough.</font>

925
00:35:26,920 --> 00:35:27,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Xi's heartbeat]
Not man enough.</font>

926
00:35:27,440 --> 00:35:28,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I had to man up at least once.</font>

927
00:35:30,360 --> 00:35:31,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, I just wanted to know...</font>

928
00:35:33,720 --> 00:35:34,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Her heartbeat quickens]
Well, actually...</font>

929
00:35:35,480 --> 00:35:36,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">About those</font>

930
00:35:38,120 --> 00:35:38,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">blocks...</font>

931
00:35:39,680 --> 00:35:41,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Cards on the table]
I knocked them over on purpose.</font>

932
00:35:45,320 --> 00:35:46,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I could have</font>

933
00:35:47,320 --> 00:35:50,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">kept them standing for that round.</font>

934
00:35:50,240 --> 00:35:51,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just wanted to know.</font>

935
00:35:53,080 --> 00:35:53,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Really?</font>

936
00:35:53,560 --> 00:35:55,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes. So I wanted to know if...</font>

937
00:35:57,400 --> 00:35:59,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't know if</font>

938
00:36:00,560 --> 00:36:03,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">my making a move would bother you.</font>

939
00:36:04,840 --> 00:36:06,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Denial #1]
No, it doesn't bother me.</font>

940
00:36:06,200 --> 00:36:08,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Denial #2]
It doesn't bother me.</font>

941
00:36:08,340 --> 00:36:09,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Denial #3]</font>

942
00:36:09,200 --> 00:36:10,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I never imagined this happening.</font>

943
00:36:10,960 --> 00:36:12,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wouldn't you prefer a guy who's...</font>

944
00:36:12,500 --> 00:36:13,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Hesitating]</font>

945
00:36:13,920 --> 00:36:15,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a bit more cheerful?</font>

946
00:36:15,280 --> 00:36:16,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not cheerful, I mean...</font>

947
00:36:17,800 --> 00:36:18,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">more outgoing?</font>

948
00:36:22,520 --> 00:36:23,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When did I ever say that?</font>

949
00:36:24,640 --> 00:36:25,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I didn't...</font>

950
00:36:25,680 --> 00:36:27,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just assumed that. Isn't that right?</font>

951
00:36:27,440 --> 00:36:29,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You think I like outgoing guys?</font>

952
00:36:32,840 --> 00:36:33,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So...</font>

953
00:36:33,560 --> 00:36:35,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">At least a bit more talkative.</font>

954
00:36:35,640 --> 00:36:36,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So you think...</font>

955
00:36:36,600 --> 00:36:37,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Someone who takes the initiative.</font>

956
00:36:38,520 --> 00:36:39,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right?</font>

957
00:36:45,080 --> 00:36:46,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's nice, but...</font>

958
00:36:47,720 --> 00:36:49,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mainly, I don't want to...</font>

959
00:36:57,240 --> 00:36:59,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Straight to the point]
I just want to get to know you.</font>

960
00:37:04,840 --> 00:37:06,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't think we've had</font>

961
00:37:07,520 --> 00:37:11,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">many chances to talk today.</font>

962
00:37:16,380 --> 00:37:29,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Still night. Hearts beat in silence.
Cicadas are deafening.]</font>

963
00:37:30,840 --> 00:37:31,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's not something</font>

964
00:37:31,960 --> 00:37:33,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you need to worry about.</font>

965
00:37:34,480 --> 00:37:35,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You wear a lot of these.</font>

966
00:37:35,680 --> 00:37:36,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did you design them?</font>

967
00:37:37,440 --> 00:37:40,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, I just like how they look.</font>

968
00:37:46,000 --> 00:37:46,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[What's on your mind?]
Any response?</font>

969
00:37:48,200 --> 00:37:49,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Could you give me one for now?</font>

970
00:37:49,800 --> 00:37:51,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">One you don't usually wear.</font>

971
00:37:51,200 --> 00:37:52,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Could I have a bracelet?</font>

972
00:37:55,880 --> 00:37:56,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't think it'll fit you.</font>

973
00:37:56,800 --> 00:37:58,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Try this one for now.</font>

974
00:37:58,120 --> 00:37:59,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's...</font>

975
00:37:59,640 --> 00:38:00,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

976
00:38:14,720 --> 00:38:16,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm really not a passive person.</font>

977
00:38:16,240 --> 00:38:17,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't keep people waiting,</font>

978
00:38:18,240 --> 00:38:20,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">or leave them guessing about things.</font>

979
00:38:21,520 --> 00:38:22,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But I need...</font>

980
00:38:23,000 --> 00:38:24,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I need a little time.</font>

981
00:38:24,720 --> 00:38:26,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Brain overheating]
I need to get my brain working.</font>

982
00:38:26,760 --> 00:38:27,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My brain's a bit...</font>

983
00:38:29,160 --> 00:38:30,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I didn't mean to...</font>

984
00:38:30,520 --> 00:38:31,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't really know what to say.</font>

985
00:38:32,360 --> 00:38:34,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But I just feel</font>

986
00:38:34,640 --> 00:38:36,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">when a girl has already...</font>

987
00:38:36,600 --> 00:38:37,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

988
00:38:37,000 --> 00:38:37,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">made herself clear,</font>

989
00:38:37,600 --> 00:38:38,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">if I don't respond...</font>

990
00:38:38,920 --> 00:38:39,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

991
00:38:39,520 --> 00:38:40,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's not very manly.</font>

992
00:38:40,200 --> 00:38:40,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

993
00:38:40,440 --> 00:38:40,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's just not right.</font>

994
00:38:41,200 --> 00:38:42,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here's how I see it.</font>

995
00:38:42,040 --> 00:38:44,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If I'm interested in you,</font>

996
00:38:44,880 --> 00:38:46,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it's natural for me to make a move.</font>

997
00:38:53,120 --> 00:38:55,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just because I make a move,</font>

998
00:38:55,400 --> 00:38:57,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you don't have to feel obliged to reply.</font>

999
00:38:57,040 --> 00:38:59,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So if that puts pressure on you...</font>

1000
00:39:00,120 --> 00:39:01,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't want you to feel pressured.</font>

1001
00:39:01,320 --> 00:39:02,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And you don't need to feel that way.</font>

1002
00:39:02,680 --> 00:39:03,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I get it. I...</font>

1003
00:39:03,600 --> 00:39:05,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And even if...</font>

1004
00:39:08,360 --> 00:39:10,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even if I'm the one</font>

1005
00:39:11,000 --> 00:39:12,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">who likes someone,</font>

1006
00:39:12,160 --> 00:39:14,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he has every right not to like me back.</font>

1007
00:39:14,720 --> 00:39:15,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's perfectly normal.</font>

1008
00:39:24,600 --> 00:39:27,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ever since yesterday, I've felt</font>

1009
00:39:28,920 --> 00:39:30,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that you're</font>

1010
00:39:31,200 --> 00:39:35,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">much more mature than I am.</font>

1011
00:39:35,320 --> 00:39:36,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And I feel</font>

1012
00:39:36,680 --> 00:39:38,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">when you talk to me, it's really</font>

1013
00:39:40,640 --> 00:39:42,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">more like you're keeping me company.</font>

1014
00:39:44,440 --> 00:39:45,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you.</font>

1015
00:39:45,400 --> 00:39:45,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you.</font>

1016
00:39:45,840 --> 00:39:47,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Speech system crashing]
Shall we head back?</font>

1017
00:39:47,680 --> 00:39:48,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I need a break.</font>

1018
00:39:48,320 --> 00:39:49,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I need to get my brain working.</font>

1019
00:39:49,480 --> 00:39:50,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can head back.</font>

1020
00:39:50,520 --> 00:39:51,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

1021
00:39:52,080 --> 00:39:52,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

1022
00:39:52,480 --> 00:39:53,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Shall we go back together?</font>

1023
00:39:53,480 --> 00:39:53,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go.</font>

1024
00:39:53,960 --> 00:39:54,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

1025
00:39:55,840 --> 00:39:57,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't feel pressured. I think...</font>

1026
00:39:57,720 --> 00:39:59,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Does this have any special meaning?</font>

1027
00:39:59,560 --> 00:39:59,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Or...</font>

1028
00:39:59,840 --> 00:40:00,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not really.</font>

1029
00:40:00,720 --> 00:40:02,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's obsidian.</font>

1030
00:40:02,080 --> 00:40:04,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It supposedly boosts
your water element.</font>

1031
00:40:04,480 --> 00:40:05,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay, I could...</font>

1032
00:40:05,120 --> 00:40:06,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">use some of that too.</font>

1033
00:40:06,000 --> 00:40:06,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay, bye.</font>

1034
00:40:06,680 --> 00:40:07,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bye.</font>

1035
00:40:12,000 --> 00:40:12,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why are you back so soon?</font>

1036
00:40:14,960 --> 00:40:15,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm back because...</font>

1037
00:40:16,520 --> 00:40:17,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it's so hot outside.</font>

1038
00:40:17,080 --> 00:40:18,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A love-triangle showdown?</font>

1039
00:40:18,200 --> 00:40:19,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There was no showdown.</font>

1040
00:40:23,280 --> 00:40:24,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Like I'd believe you.</font>

1041
00:40:25,520 --> 00:40:27,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When she pinned you to the wall,</font>

1042
00:40:27,160 --> 00:40:28,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Claire's expression changed.</font>

1043
00:40:32,040 --> 00:40:33,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No way.</font>

1044
00:40:33,080 --> 00:40:34,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I swear on my life I'm not lying.</font>

1045
00:40:34,880 --> 00:40:37,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can sense these things, bro.</font>

1046
00:40:37,080 --> 00:40:38,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your instincts can't be that accurate.</font>

1047
00:40:38,920 --> 00:40:39,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who can you read accurately?</font>

1048
00:40:39,520 --> 00:40:40,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Me, or who?</font>

1049
00:40:40,240 --> 00:40:41,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can read everyone accurately.</font>

1050
00:40:42,720 --> 00:40:44,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just couldn't</font>

1051
00:40:44,200 --> 00:40:45,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">choose another guy,</font>

1052
00:40:45,560 --> 00:40:46,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you know?</font>

1053
00:40:46,040 --> 00:40:47,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He saved me,</font>

1054
00:40:47,160 --> 00:40:48,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and picked me for his team too.</font>

1055
00:40:48,880 --> 00:40:50,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah, he's a good guy.</font>

1056
00:40:50,280 --> 00:40:51,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's why I chose him.</font>

1057
00:40:51,840 --> 00:40:53,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Xi's amazing.</font>

1058
00:40:53,160 --> 00:40:56,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah. She did what I didn't dare to do.</font>

1059
00:40:56,600 --> 00:40:57,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You know?</font>

1060
00:40:58,960 --> 00:40:59,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Could it be</font>

1061
00:40:59,600 --> 00:41:01,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that a guy who's so proper</font>

1062
00:41:01,200 --> 00:41:03,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">needs a girl like you...</font>

1063
00:41:03,040 --> 00:41:04,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who's a bit of a flirt.</font>

1064
00:41:04,000 --> 00:41:05,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes, to give him a push?</font>

1065
00:41:05,560 --> 00:41:07,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, I don't really want to push him.</font>

1066
00:41:07,080 --> 00:41:08,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So did you two talk just now?</font>

1067
00:41:08,920 --> 00:41:11,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I feel like neither of us</font>

1068
00:41:11,880 --> 00:41:15,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">had quite worked out what to say.</font>

1069
00:41:15,160 --> 00:41:16,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So what did you talk about?</font>

1070
00:41:16,400 --> 00:41:17,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Mind blank]
What did he say just now?</font>

1071
00:41:17,960 --> 00:41:20,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Nothing in 20 minutes?
You don't remember?</font>

1072
00:41:20,320 --> 00:41:21,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Does that change anything for you?</font>

1073
00:41:22,000 --> 00:41:23,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

1074
00:41:23,520 --> 00:41:24,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It doesn't?</font>

1075
00:41:24,520 --> 00:41:25,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Change what?</font>

1076
00:41:25,000 --> 00:41:26,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What I just told you,</font>

1077
00:41:26,440 --> 00:41:27,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">after you came back,</font>

1078
00:41:27,480 --> 00:41:28,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">doesn't change anything?</font>

1079
00:41:29,280 --> 00:41:30,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Information overload]
I need to think.</font>

1080
00:41:30,160 --> 00:41:30,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Today, I...</font>

1081
00:41:30,400 --> 00:41:31,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My brain can't keep up right now.</font>

1082
00:41:31,480 --> 00:41:31,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

1083
00:41:31,880 --> 00:41:33,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you still interested</font>

1084
00:41:33,840 --> 00:41:34,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in the girl who asked you out earlier?</font>

1085
00:41:35,760 --> 00:41:37,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can we not talk about this right now?</font>

1086
00:41:37,800 --> 00:41:39,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">His head's a mess right now.</font>

1087
00:41:39,240 --> 00:41:39,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let him think.</font>

1088
00:41:39,680 --> 00:41:40,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You don't know? Then...</font>

1089
00:41:40,800 --> 00:41:42,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Because when he came back,</font>

1090
00:41:42,280 --> 00:41:43,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I told him</font>

1091
00:41:43,320 --> 00:41:43,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">something else.</font>

1092
00:41:57,600 --> 00:42:00,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I had such mixed feelings that day.</font>

1093
00:42:00,280 --> 00:42:02,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was ready to leave the island.</font>

1094
00:42:07,600 --> 00:42:09,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tell us if you're unhappy.</font>

1095
00:42:09,120 --> 00:42:10,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We really don't want you to...</font>

1096
00:42:16,040 --> 00:42:18,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[After dinner today]
Yeah, because Zhang Yi...</font>

1097
00:42:18,000 --> 00:42:18,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She said she wanted to leave.</font>

1098
00:42:19,920 --> 00:42:20,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tonight,</font>

1099
00:42:20,560 --> 00:42:22,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ke'er and I were busy cooking.</font>

1100
00:42:22,960 --> 00:42:25,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She probably doesn't know
the others very well.</font>

1101
00:42:26,120 --> 00:42:27,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And you weren't there,</font>

1102
00:42:27,480 --> 00:42:28,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so she just sat there alone.</font>

1103
00:42:28,480 --> 00:42:30,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She looked really unhappy.</font>

1104
00:42:31,120 --> 00:42:31,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She...</font>

1105
00:42:31,360 --> 00:42:32,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You may be the only guy she likes,</font>

1106
00:42:32,720 --> 00:42:33,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but you treat her like a sidekick.</font>

1107
00:42:33,440 --> 00:42:34,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So she really wanted to leave.</font>

1108
00:42:34,320 --> 00:42:35,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

1109
00:42:35,840 --> 00:42:37,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You really broke your sidekick's heart.</font>

1110
00:42:37,960 --> 00:42:39,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You haven't been a very good big bro.</font>

1111
00:42:45,360 --> 00:42:45,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll try.</font>

1112
00:42:45,920 --> 00:42:48,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll try to settle in a bit more.</font>

1113
00:42:50,640 --> 00:42:51,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've got this.</font>

1114
00:42:51,320 --> 00:42:52,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can do it.</font>

1115
00:42:52,800 --> 00:42:54,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You came on this show,</font>

1116
00:42:54,240 --> 00:42:55,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so you must want</font>

1117
00:42:56,440 --> 00:42:57,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to have some fun.</font>

1118
00:42:58,320 --> 00:43:00,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't miss this chance.</font>

1119
00:43:00,680 --> 00:43:01,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Exactly.</font>

1120
00:43:01,920 --> 00:43:02,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You haven't...</font>

1121
00:43:02,480 --> 00:43:03,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I believe in you.</font>

1122
00:43:03,240 --> 00:43:04,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You really haven't experienced</font>

1123
00:43:04,400 --> 00:43:05,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the romantic drama we've been through.</font>

1124
00:43:05,800 --> 00:43:06,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[A sworn alliance at the bar]
Come on, the three of us.</font>

1125
00:43:06,880 --> 00:43:07,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on.</font>

1126
00:43:09,560 --> 00:43:10,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You two are so nice.</font>

1127
00:43:10,560 --> 00:43:12,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're one of us now.</font>

1128
00:43:13,000 --> 00:43:14,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just think of us as your bros.</font>

1129
00:43:14,960 --> 00:43:15,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

1130
00:43:15,480 --> 00:43:17,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're the Changsha Twin Stars.</font>

1131
00:43:17,080 --> 00:43:17,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Changsha Twin Stars.</font>

1132
00:43:17,720 --> 00:43:20,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Both stars came
crashing down today.</font>

1133
00:43:20,360 --> 00:43:21,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Before we headed out,</font>

1134
00:43:21,160 --> 00:43:22,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he was still so full of confidence.</font>

1135
00:43:22,280 --> 00:43:24,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, let's take a walk over there.</font>

1136
00:43:24,320 --> 00:43:24,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's walk.</font>

1137
00:43:25,320 --> 00:43:26,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on.</font>

1138
00:43:26,840 --> 00:43:28,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When do we give out
Moonstones today?</font>

1139
00:43:28,120 --> 00:43:29,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No rush.</font>

1140
00:43:29,000 --> 00:43:30,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go for now.</font>

1141
00:43:30,160 --> 00:43:31,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's chat.</font>

1142
00:43:32,000 --> 00:43:33,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look at the three of us walking.</font>

1143
00:43:33,040 --> 00:43:34,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No cameras are following us.</font>

1144
00:43:34,280 --> 00:43:35,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Clearly, none of us has a love story.</font>

1145
00:43:35,800 --> 00:43:36,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Three platonic buddies]
Nothing to edit.</font>

1146
00:43:39,400 --> 00:43:41,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're just buddies. No romance.</font>

1147
00:43:42,840 --> 00:43:43,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You just said that...</font>

1148
00:43:44,960 --> 00:43:45,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[A cameraman rushes over]
And now one's here.</font>

1149
00:43:45,960 --> 00:43:47,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">None were following us.</font>

1150
00:43:47,520 --> 00:43:48,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The two of us can...</font>

1151
00:43:48,440 --> 00:43:49,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You stand in the middle. We'll...</font>

1152
00:43:49,240 --> 00:43:50,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You go in the middle.</font>

1153
00:43:50,040 --> 00:43:50,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'll protect you.</font>

1154
00:43:50,760 --> 00:43:51,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Protect you.</font>

1155
00:43:51,200 --> 00:43:51,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

1156
00:43:52,440 --> 00:43:54,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even though we're on a dating show,</font>

1157
00:43:54,280 --> 00:43:55,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we should still</font>

1158
00:43:55,240 --> 00:43:56,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">do what feels right to us.</font>

1159
00:43:56,840 --> 00:43:57,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

1160
00:43:57,320 --> 00:43:57,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right?</font>

1161
00:43:57,720 --> 00:43:58,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Because it's a...</font>

1162
00:43:58,280 --> 00:44:00,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's an unscripted environment.</font>

1163
00:44:00,600 --> 00:44:01,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And I think</font>

1164
00:44:01,320 --> 00:44:02,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">there's no need to force anything.</font>

1165
00:44:02,000 --> 00:44:03,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah, no need to force it.</font>

1166
00:44:03,360 --> 00:44:05,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just follow your heart. Yeah.</font>

1167
00:44:05,640 --> 00:44:07,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you like a guy, vote for him.</font>

1168
00:44:07,280 --> 00:44:08,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't save your votes for us. It's okay.</font>

1169
00:44:13,760 --> 00:44:15,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who's that with who?</font>

1170
00:44:15,360 --> 00:44:16,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why are there three...</font>

1171
00:44:16,520 --> 00:44:17,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Two people.</font>

1172
00:44:17,840 --> 00:44:18,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who's that?</font>

1173
00:44:18,200 --> 00:44:19,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The one in black.</font>

1174
00:44:19,460 --> 00:44:21,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Let me get a closer look]</font>

1175
00:44:22,520 --> 00:44:22,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Uh-oh!]
Let's go.</font>

1176
00:44:23,760 --> 00:44:24,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Looks like Annie.</font>

1177
00:44:25,840 --> 00:44:26,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Annie, I can't lose you]
Is that Annie?</font>

1178
00:44:27,640 --> 00:44:28,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Annie and Liang Yongfeng.</font>

1179
00:44:28,920 --> 00:44:29,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Annie and Liang Yongfeng.</font>

1180
00:44:31,680 --> 00:44:32,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Keep your eyes shut tight.</font>

1181
00:44:34,080 --> 00:44:35,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go. Retreat!</font>

1182
00:44:35,360 --> 00:44:35,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Close your eyes.</font>

1183
00:44:35,920 --> 00:44:37,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Love makes you blind]
I wish I hadn't worn my glasses.</font>

1184
00:44:37,760 --> 00:44:39,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Didn't I tell you earlier?</font>

1185
00:44:40,160 --> 00:44:42,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Every choice I've made</font>

1186
00:44:42,960 --> 00:44:45,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">has been true to my own feelings.</font>

1187
00:44:46,920 --> 00:44:47,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who's that?</font>

1188
00:44:47,880 --> 00:44:49,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Feng.</font>

1189
00:44:49,240 --> 00:44:50,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Annie.</font>

1190
00:44:52,560 --> 00:44:53,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So this...</font>

1191
00:44:53,800 --> 00:44:55,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait, our Gao's heartbroken.</font>

1192
00:44:55,600 --> 00:44:56,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Our Gao...</font>

1193
00:44:56,800 --> 00:44:58,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">His heart's in pieces.</font>

1194
00:44:58,280 --> 00:44:59,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where's Gao?</font>

1195
00:45:00,360 --> 00:45:01,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Gao!</font>

1196
00:45:02,080 --> 00:45:03,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Want to join us?</font>

1197
00:45:03,280 --> 00:45:04,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dong!</font>

1198
00:45:04,520 --> 00:45:06,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The three unlucky buddies are here.</font>

1199
00:45:06,140 --> 00:45:07,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Three unlucky buddies]</font>

1200
00:45:07,960 --> 00:45:09,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Curious]
What happened?</font>

1201
00:45:10,200 --> 00:45:10,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me tell you.</font>

1202
00:45:10,720 --> 00:45:11,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We just ran into two people.</font>

1203
00:45:11,840 --> 00:45:12,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I wondered why there was a light.</font>

1204
00:45:12,880 --> 00:45:13,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then I looked up,</font>

1205
00:45:13,600 --> 00:45:14,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and Annie was talking to someone else.</font>

1206
00:45:14,660 --> 00:45:16,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Seeing his crush on a date
with someone else]</font>

1207
00:45:16,340 --> 00:45:17,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Heartbroken]</font>

1208
00:45:17,320 --> 00:45:18,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He put his glasses on.</font>

1209
00:45:18,960 --> 00:45:20,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who's more embarrassed here? I think...</font>

1210
00:45:21,320 --> 00:45:22,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's a bit more embarrassed.</font>

1211
00:45:23,040 --> 00:45:25,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">At least you two can get along.</font>

1212
00:45:25,160 --> 00:45:26,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

1213
00:45:26,680 --> 00:45:28,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why are you embarrassed?</font>

1214
00:45:28,040 --> 00:45:29,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm dying of embarrassment.</font>

1215
00:45:29,240 --> 00:45:30,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tell us what happened.</font>

1216
00:45:30,840 --> 00:45:32,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't tell him any of this.</font>

1217
00:45:32,920 --> 00:45:33,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We won't.</font>

1218
00:45:33,680 --> 00:45:34,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're not roommates.</font>

1219
00:45:34,440 --> 00:45:35,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[We're not close]
We're not roommates.</font>

1220
00:45:35,400 --> 00:45:37,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's just us three who are close.</font>

1221
00:45:37,880 --> 00:45:39,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was just thinking,</font>

1222
00:45:39,280 --> 00:45:41,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">if I were a guy,</font>

1223
00:45:41,000 --> 00:45:42,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and he were a girl,</font>

1224
00:45:42,400 --> 00:45:44,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what I did just now wasn't right.</font>

1225
00:45:44,280 --> 00:45:47,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I put a lot of pressure on him.</font>

1226
00:45:49,240 --> 00:45:50,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Maybe, to me,</font>

1227
00:45:50,160 --> 00:45:52,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I make a move because I'm interested.</font>

1228
00:45:52,240 --> 00:45:53,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So...</font>

1229
00:45:53,520 --> 00:45:54,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How do I put this?</font>

1230
00:45:54,040 --> 00:45:55,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's not that I want to lock him down.</font>

1231
00:45:55,480 --> 00:45:57,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But if everyone keeps teasing us,</font>

1232
00:45:57,080 --> 00:45:58,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and he feels</font>

1233
00:45:58,360 --> 00:45:59,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">forced to accept it,</font>

1234
00:46:01,240 --> 00:46:02,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">if there's another girl he likes...</font>

1235
00:46:02,480 --> 00:46:03,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He'd feel awkward.</font>

1236
00:46:03,040 --> 00:46:03,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah, he would.</font>

1237
00:46:03,920 --> 00:46:04,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And...</font>

1238
00:46:05,400 --> 00:46:06,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he wouldn't be able to relax.</font>

1239
00:46:06,320 --> 00:46:08,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't want to put him
under that kind of pressure.</font>

1240
00:46:10,660 --> 00:46:13,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Doesn't want to pressure Wang Sheng]</font>

1241
00:46:40,200 --> 00:46:40,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why aren't you outside?</font>

1242
00:46:41,600 --> 00:46:42,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why? Are they chatting?</font>

1243
00:46:42,840 --> 00:46:43,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Want to do some bench presses?</font>

1244
00:46:45,000 --> 00:46:45,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bench presses?</font>

1245
00:46:47,120 --> 00:46:47,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How do we do that?</font>

1246
00:46:47,840 --> 00:46:49,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">With those little dumbbells?</font>

1247
00:46:49,600 --> 00:46:50,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

1248
00:46:50,320 --> 00:46:51,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can keep you company.</font>

1249
00:46:53,720 --> 00:46:55,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Warm up a bit. Better than nothing.</font>

1250
00:46:56,360 --> 00:46:58,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">First, this is a dating show, right?</font>

1251
00:46:58,040 --> 00:47:00,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's normal to have someone you like</font>

1252
00:47:00,120 --> 00:47:01,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">on a dating show.</font>

1253
00:47:01,320 --> 00:47:02,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In this setting,</font>

1254
00:47:02,480 --> 00:47:03,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Offering comfort]
there are bound to be games like this.</font>

1255
00:47:03,880 --> 00:47:06,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">These games give everyone a chance.</font>

1256
00:47:07,400 --> 00:47:07,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right?</font>

1257
00:47:09,040 --> 00:47:09,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Watching from afar]
Boss,</font>

1258
00:47:09,600 --> 00:47:12,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">if we just keep doing bench presses,</font>

1259
00:47:13,560 --> 00:47:14,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">will we really last till the end?</font>

1260
00:47:16,160 --> 00:47:17,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sure. You'll definitely make it.</font>

1261
00:47:18,400 --> 00:47:18,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop it.</font>

1262
00:47:18,760 --> 00:47:21,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've got the best chance now, bro.</font>

1263
00:47:21,720 --> 00:47:23,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Wants to get closer]
Want to go check on them?</font>

1264
00:47:23,360 --> 00:47:24,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Want to go have a look?</font>

1265
00:47:24,520 --> 00:47:25,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just a quick look.</font>

1266
00:47:25,840 --> 00:47:26,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's take a look, then come back.</font>

1267
00:47:28,080 --> 00:47:29,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why? Is the girl you like over there?</font>

1268
00:47:29,400 --> 00:47:30,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They're all talking. Let's have a look.</font>

1269
00:47:30,660 --> 00:47:32,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Getting closer]</font>

1270
00:47:32,560 --> 00:47:34,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Second, I think making the first move</font>

1271
00:47:34,640 --> 00:47:35,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is really no big deal.</font>

1272
00:47:35,800 --> 00:47:37,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Besides, he was absolutely loving it.</font>

1273
00:47:37,200 --> 00:47:38,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Feeling reassured]
And you're here...</font>

1274
00:47:39,800 --> 00:47:40,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think you're being too sensitive.</font>

1275
00:47:40,960 --> 00:47:42,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think he really enjoyed it.</font>

1276
00:47:42,920 --> 00:47:43,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who are we talking about?</font>

1277
00:47:47,040 --> 00:47:48,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The guys in the dorm next door.</font>

1278
00:47:48,840 --> 00:47:50,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Those three guys.</font>

1279
00:47:50,080 --> 00:47:51,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who's that girl?</font>

1280
00:47:51,240 --> 00:47:52,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The girl?</font>

1281
00:47:56,260 --> 00:47:58,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Spots Wang Sheng]</font>

1282
00:48:07,720 --> 00:48:09,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ren Chunxi, and...</font>

1283
00:48:09,720 --> 00:48:10,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hu Ke'er.</font>

1284
00:48:11,880 --> 00:48:12,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Zhang Yi.</font>

1285
00:48:18,040 --> 00:48:18,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go.</font>

1286
00:48:26,240 --> 00:48:28,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you that worried?</font>

1287
00:48:28,040 --> 00:48:30,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, aren't they just chatting?</font>

1288
00:48:30,800 --> 00:48:32,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just checking in on them, huh?</font>

1289
00:48:32,240 --> 00:48:33,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah. Just curious. Having a look.</font>

1290
00:48:34,800 --> 00:48:36,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Aren't you checking on "Clean"?</font>

1291
00:48:37,180 --> 00:48:38,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Who?]</font>

1292
00:48:39,280 --> 00:48:40,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Claire Cai]
What about "Clean"?</font>

1293
00:48:43,960 --> 00:48:45,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We've barely talked.</font>

1294
00:48:45,600 --> 00:48:46,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not even a couple of sentences.</font>

1295
00:48:48,360 --> 00:48:50,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm the kind of person who...</font>

1296
00:48:50,000 --> 00:48:51,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If a guy doesn't</font>

1297
00:48:51,120 --> 00:48:54,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">give me a slightly clearer signal,</font>

1298
00:48:54,360 --> 00:48:57,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I won't get too close to him.</font>

1299
00:48:57,200 --> 00:48:57,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Needs a clear signal to act]
I get it.</font>

1300
00:48:57,760 --> 00:48:58,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm like that too.</font>

1301
00:48:58,800 --> 00:49:00,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So...</font>

1302
00:49:00,280 --> 00:49:02,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And I don't like guys</font>

1303
00:49:02,280 --> 00:49:03,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">who joke around too much.</font>

1304
00:49:03,320 --> 00:49:04,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I find it so...</font>

1305
00:49:06,200 --> 00:49:07,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't like it.</font>

1306
00:49:08,520 --> 00:49:09,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Knowing Koala,</font>

1307
00:49:09,440 --> 00:49:11,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he definitely wants to be with her.</font>

1308
00:49:11,360 --> 00:49:12,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He wants her.</font>

1309
00:49:16,120 --> 00:49:16,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

1310
00:49:17,040 --> 00:49:18,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait...</font>

1311
00:49:18,640 --> 00:49:20,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That guy was loving it!</font>

1312
00:49:20,760 --> 00:49:22,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't make assumptions.</font>

1313
00:49:23,760 --> 00:49:24,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait.</font>

1314
00:49:24,160 --> 00:49:25,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have a video.</font>

1315
00:49:25,000 --> 00:49:26,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did I record it?</font>

1316
00:49:26,680 --> 00:49:26,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No,</font>

1317
00:49:26,880 --> 00:49:28,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">let me hear their stories first.</font>

1318
00:49:28,120 --> 00:49:28,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Cheer me up a bit.</font>

1319
00:49:28,880 --> 00:49:29,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on.</font>

1320
00:49:29,680 --> 00:49:32,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Any declarations of heartbreak?</font>

1321
00:49:32,320 --> 00:49:33,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Declarations of heartbreak?</font>

1322
00:49:33,240 --> 00:49:34,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

1323
00:49:34,160 --> 00:49:35,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's my declaration of heartbreak?</font>

1324
00:49:37,160 --> 00:49:40,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm never being the funny guy again.</font>

1325
00:49:43,640 --> 00:49:45,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Funny guys don't find love.</font>

1326
00:49:45,080 --> 00:49:46,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They say nice guys rank below dogs.</font>

1327
00:49:46,640 --> 00:49:48,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Funny guys rank below nice guys.</font>

1328
00:49:49,640 --> 00:49:50,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait.</font>

1329
00:49:50,960 --> 00:49:52,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The guy's on our left.</font>

1330
00:49:54,480 --> 00:49:56,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[He's right next to us]
Keep your voice down.</font>

1331
00:49:56,120 --> 00:49:56,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can I join you?</font>

1332
00:49:56,840 --> 00:49:58,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Request to join the group chat]
Sure.</font>

1333
00:49:58,000 --> 00:49:58,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on.</font>

1334
00:49:58,760 --> 00:49:59,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You probably haven't heard</font>

1335
00:49:59,480 --> 00:50:00,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Siyang's story yet.</font>

1336
00:50:00,400 --> 00:50:00,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Siyang's story?</font>

1337
00:50:00,880 --> 00:50:01,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How could you not know?</font>

1338
00:50:01,640 --> 00:50:02,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everyone knows.</font>

1339
00:50:02,920 --> 00:50:04,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So today, Siyang</font>

1340
00:50:04,440 --> 00:50:06,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">got himself all dressed up,</font>

1341
00:50:06,960 --> 00:50:07,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but when he got there...</font>

1342
00:50:08,960 --> 00:50:11,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When I saw the three of them,</font>

1343
00:50:11,000 --> 00:50:12,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it was brutal.</font>

1344
00:50:12,040 --> 00:50:12,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was honestly...</font>

1345
00:50:12,720 --> 00:50:13,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hi, everyone.</font>

1346
00:50:13,920 --> 00:50:15,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where's Zhenyu?</font>

1347
00:50:15,640 --> 00:50:17,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In the bathroom.</font>

1348
00:50:17,120 --> 00:50:18,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[One more joins the chat]
I was walking along here,</font>

1349
00:50:18,760 --> 00:50:20,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and from a distance, I saw</font>

1350
00:50:20,920 --> 00:50:21,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">this picture-perfect couple.</font>

1351
00:50:22,800 --> 00:50:23,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They were having dinner.</font>

1352
00:50:23,580 --> 00:50:24,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Reliving the awkwardness]</font>

1353
00:50:25,080 --> 00:50:26,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then I noticed</font>

1354
00:50:26,400 --> 00:50:27,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tianqing wouldn't leave.</font>

1355
00:50:27,920 --> 00:50:29,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He just sat there and wouldn't leave.</font>

1356
00:50:29,680 --> 00:50:32,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So I said, "Make some room for me."</font>

1357
00:50:32,720 --> 00:50:36,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tianqing and I</font>

1358
00:50:36,120 --> 00:50:38,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Friends share a seat]
were cuddled up like this.</font>

1359
00:50:38,920 --> 00:50:39,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll play Tianqing.</font>

1360
00:50:39,800 --> 00:50:40,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah, we were just like that.</font>

1361
00:50:41,480 --> 00:50:42,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It started with the three of us</font>

1362
00:50:42,800 --> 00:50:44,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">chatting here, and now</font>

1363
00:50:44,560 --> 00:50:45,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the whole gang's here.</font>

1364
00:50:47,640 --> 00:50:48,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Time to go, huh?</font>

1365
00:50:48,960 --> 00:50:49,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go.</font>

1366
00:50:49,880 --> 00:50:51,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The "Changsha Twin Stars"
are about to fall.</font>

1367
00:50:51,480 --> 00:50:52,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Give us more airtime, okay?</font>

1368
00:50:52,400 --> 00:50:53,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stand right at the front.</font>

1369
00:50:53,560 --> 00:50:54,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But I really want to stay.</font>

1370
00:50:54,600 --> 00:50:55,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you want to give me Moonstones,</font>

1371
00:50:55,920 --> 00:50:56,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">please do.</font>

1372
00:51:00,440 --> 00:51:02,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Attention, all islanders.</font>

1373
00:51:02,280 --> 00:51:04,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Moon of Affection is now lit.</font>

1374
00:51:04,960 --> 00:51:07,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please go to the Moon of Affection</font>

1375
00:51:07,360 --> 00:51:09,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for today's affection voting.</font>

1376
00:51:09,840 --> 00:51:12,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Every feeling flows like moonlight.</font>

1377
00:51:12,320 --> 00:51:15,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Every sign of affection
makes the moon complete.</font>

1378
00:51:15,640 --> 00:51:19,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Moon of Affection: Voting Begins]
For whom does your full moon rise?</font>

1379
00:51:21,400 --> 00:51:22,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How did you vote?</font>

1380
00:51:22,280 --> 00:51:23,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Four and one.</font>

1381
00:51:24,320 --> 00:51:25,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">One left over.</font>

1382
00:51:25,920 --> 00:51:26,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't tell me you gave Yi just one.</font>

1383
00:51:26,840 --> 00:51:27,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Who got his votes?]
Can't say.</font>

1384
00:51:31,620 --> 00:51:33,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Gao to ???: 4 Moonstones]</font>

1385
00:51:36,020 --> 00:51:38,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Gao to ???: 1 Moonstone]</font>

1386
00:51:41,700 --> 00:51:44,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Gao to Shihan: 1 Moonstone]</font>

1387
00:51:44,420 --> 00:51:45,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Gao to Yi: 4 Moonstones]</font>

1388
00:51:45,680 --> 00:51:46,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yi and I</font>

1389
00:51:46,480 --> 00:51:47,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">really are just good friends.</font>

1390
00:51:47,560 --> 00:51:50,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I made a point of talking to her today</font>

1391
00:51:50,000 --> 00:51:51,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">because I was worried</font>

1392
00:51:51,440 --> 00:51:53,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I hadn't explained things clearly,</font>

1393
00:51:53,400 --> 00:51:53,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and she'd feel hurt.</font>

1394
00:51:53,920 --> 00:51:56,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'd feel terrible if that happened.</font>

1395
00:51:56,240 --> 00:51:57,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But the girl I'm attracted to</font>

1396
00:51:57,000 --> 00:51:58,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is definitely Shihan.</font>

1397
00:51:58,980 --> 00:52:00,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[His crush: Qian Shihan]</font>

1398
00:52:01,000 --> 00:52:02,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can't fool myself, right?</font>

1399
00:52:02,640 --> 00:52:03,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I still think</font>

1400
00:52:05,280 --> 00:52:06,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I should give at least one Moonstone</font>

1401
00:52:06,080 --> 00:52:08,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to the girl I'm drawn to.</font>

1402
00:52:09,240 --> 00:52:11,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Building a friendship on a dating show,</font>

1403
00:52:11,760 --> 00:52:12,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we're in a league of our own.</font>

1404
00:52:13,320 --> 00:52:14,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think</font>

1405
00:52:16,640 --> 00:52:17,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what we have is pretty good.</font>

1406
00:52:18,640 --> 00:52:19,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Checking on my little buddy, Yi.</font>

1407
00:52:20,040 --> 00:52:20,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Otherwise, she'd be on her own</font>

1408
00:52:20,880 --> 00:52:22,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and feel so lonely.</font>

1409
00:52:22,120 --> 00:52:23,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And her friend has left too.</font>

1410
00:52:24,440 --> 00:52:25,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

1411
00:52:27,920 --> 00:52:28,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How should I put it?</font>

1412
00:52:28,800 --> 00:52:29,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think</font>

1413
