1415
00:52:35,920 --> 00:52:37,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Yi to Gao: 4 Moonstones]
I don't know what else to say.</font>

1416
00:52:38,720 --> 00:52:39,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm being subtle,</font>

1417
00:52:39,760 --> 00:52:41,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but you know what I mean.</font>

1418
00:52:42,440 --> 00:52:43,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">"A master of keeping everyone happy."</font>

1419
00:52:43,880 --> 00:52:44,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

1420
00:52:45,280 --> 00:52:46,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But I think</font>

1421
00:52:46,160 --> 00:52:48,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he might feel more affection for you.</font>

1422
00:52:49,360 --> 00:52:50,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's the theme of the show.</font>

1423
00:52:52,720 --> 00:52:53,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I had a three-person date today.</font>

1424
00:52:55,000 --> 00:52:56,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You and Gao</font>

1425
00:52:56,080 --> 00:52:57,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">both picked her, right?</font>

1426
00:52:57,600 --> 00:52:59,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think I'll bump Shihan</font>

1427
00:52:59,000 --> 00:53:00,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">up to three Moonstones today.</font>

1428
00:53:01,800 --> 00:53:02,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Yongfeng to Shihan: 3 Moonstones]
Because I really value</font>

1429
00:53:02,800 --> 00:53:04,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the people I spend each day with.</font>

1430
00:53:04,920 --> 00:53:07,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even if I don't get to know her better,</font>

1431
00:53:07,200 --> 00:53:08,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll still give her my Moonstones.</font>

1432
00:53:09,840 --> 00:53:10,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can you tell</font>

1433
00:53:10,680 --> 00:53:12,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">which of you two she prefers?</font>

1434
00:53:13,760 --> 00:53:15,160
