1435
00:53:17,400 --> 00:53:18,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me just vent for a second.</font>

1436
00:53:18,400 --> 00:53:19,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">On a dating show, it's really hard</font>

1437
00:53:19,680 --> 00:53:21,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to find someone who's right for you.</font>

1438
00:53:21,440 --> 00:53:23,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Hard to find someone you like]
You might feel forced into it,</font>

1439
00:53:23,080 --> 00:53:24,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and then...</font>

1440
00:53:24,200 --> 00:53:25,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

1441
00:53:25,280 --> 00:53:27,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you're making me vote,</font>

1442
00:53:27,280 --> 00:53:29,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'd throw them all away, honestly.</font>

1443
00:53:30,120 --> 00:53:32,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But I've got a strategy, you know.</font>

1444
00:53:32,000 --> 00:53:34,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Shihan to Gao: 2 Moonstones]
Two Moonstones.</font>

1445
00:53:34,400 --> 00:53:35,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Shihan to Yongfeng: 2 Moonstones]
And one for Dong.</font>

1446
00:53:35,520 --> 00:53:37,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's least likely to be misread.</font>

1447
00:53:37,840 --> 00:53:40,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Shihan to Dong: 1 Moonstone]
Three-two? They'd say I have a favorite.</font>

1448
00:53:40,120 --> 00:53:41,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't have a favorite, okay?</font>

1449
00:53:42,260 --> 00:53:45,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[No extra affection]</font>

1450
00:53:47,880 --> 00:53:48,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How did your voting go?</font>

1451
00:53:49,840 --> 00:53:51,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I made a really wild decision.</font>

1452
00:53:53,000 --> 00:53:54,320
