1456
00:54:03,200 --> 00:54:04,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who did you talk to? Dong?</font>

1457
00:54:06,560 --> 00:54:08,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Maybe it's because</font>

1458
00:54:08,480 --> 00:54:11,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I put him in the danger zone
on day one,</font>

1459
00:54:11,640 --> 00:54:13,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and I felt a little guilty.</font>

1460
00:54:14,460 --> 00:54:16,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Ke'er to Dong: 5 Moonstones]</font>

1461
00:54:16,280 --> 00:54:19,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's just like I said before.</font>

1462
00:54:19,000 --> 00:54:20,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's outgoing and gentle,</font>

1463
00:54:20,640 --> 00:54:23,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and knows how to support people.</font>

1464
00:54:23,440 --> 00:54:25,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So he really fits</font>

1465
00:54:25,520 --> 00:54:27,680
