1466
00:54:28,840 --> 00:54:30,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Annie asked Dong during Truth or Dare,</font>

1467
00:54:30,360 --> 00:54:32,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">or maybe it was a truth question,</font>

1468
00:54:32,120 --> 00:54:33,520
