1469
00:54:33,520 --> 00:54:35,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he's interested in right now.</font>

1470
00:54:35,400 --> 00:54:36,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And Dong said just one.</font>

1471
00:54:36,960 --> 00:54:39,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Truth or Dare]
How many girls are you interested in?</font>

