1474
00:54:43,240 --> 00:54:44,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So much affection.</font>

1475
00:54:46,600 --> 00:54:47,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's definitely her.</font>

1476
00:54:48,360 --> 00:54:50,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But I'm still wondering if it's me.</font>

1477
00:54:50,920 --> 00:54:51,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Definitely you.</font>

1478
00:54:51,600 --> 00:54:54,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I feel like</font>

1479
00:54:54,640 --> 00:54:56,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he wants to look after everyone,</font>

1480
00:54:56,920 --> 00:54:57,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so I feel</font>

1481
00:54:57,520 --> 00:54:59,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he's actually nice to everyone.</font>

1482
00:55:01,080 --> 00:55:02,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All five for her.</font>

1483
00:55:02,840 --> 00:55:04,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Dong to Ke'er: 5 Moonstones]
To me, Ke'er...</font>

1484
00:55:04,880 --> 00:55:06,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's the one I know best,</font>

1485
00:55:06,120 --> 00:55:07,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and we get on really well.</font>

1486
00:55:07,400 --> 00:55:09,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I gave her all five both times.</font>

1487
00:55:10,360 --> 00:55:11,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I treat the five as one vote.</font>

1488
00:55:13,120 --> 00:55:13,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I told myself,</font>

1489
00:55:13,760 --> 00:55:15,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Affection for just one]
if I can only choose one person...</font>

1490
00:55:20,480 --> 00:55:21,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How many girls interest you</font>

1491
00:55:22,280 --> 00:55:22,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">right now?</font>

1492
00:55:22,840 --> 00:55:23,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">One.</font>

1493
00:55:24,200 --> 00:55:24,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[His affection is for one girl too]
Just one.</font>

1494
00:55:24,960 --> 00:55:26,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All your affection for one girl.</font>

1495
00:55:26,040 --> 00:55:27,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All that affection. Right on theme.</font>

1496
00:55:27,760 --> 00:55:28,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Zhenyu to Xinran: 5 Moonstones]
That's the theme.</font>

1497
00:55:28,160 --> 00:55:28,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Affection.</font>

1498
00:55:28,720 --> 00:55:29,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right on theme.</font>

1499
00:55:30,680 --> 00:55:32,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How was your chat with Zhenyu today?</font>

1500
00:55:33,680 --> 00:55:35,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We talked about relationships.</font>

1501
00:55:36,240 --> 00:55:38,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Zhenyu asks Xinran for a private chat]
Have you ever thought</font>

1502
00:55:38,640 --> 00:55:40,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">about what kind of personality</font>

1503
00:55:40,200 --> 00:55:41,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">would be a good match for you?</font>

1504
00:55:42,880 --> 00:55:43,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have,</font>

1505
00:55:43,480 --> 00:55:45,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but I go with my feelings.</font>

1506
00:55:45,920 --> 00:55:48,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We need to have fun and talk easily.</font>

1507
00:55:49,080 --> 00:55:52,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Seeking a deep connection]
It's more about a mental connection.</font>

1508
00:55:54,200 --> 00:55:57,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When it comes to falling in love,</font>

1509
00:55:57,360 --> 00:55:59,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it's not like I always have...</font>

1510
00:55:59,560 --> 00:56:01,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a fixed type, I guess.</font>

1511
00:56:01,800 --> 00:56:02,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but I don't know why</font>

1512
00:56:02,600 --> 00:56:04,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I feel drawn to someone.</font>

1513
00:56:04,440 --> 00:56:05,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[No fixed type, just feelings]
There's just a feeling.</font>

1514
00:56:05,080 --> 00:56:06,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Maybe we've only just met,</font>

1515
00:56:06,640 --> 00:56:09,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">or spent time together once or twice,</font>

1516
00:56:09,440 --> 00:56:10,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and I'll think,</font>

1517
00:56:11,960 --> 00:56:13,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">"I'm drawn to this girl."</font>

1518
00:56:13,600 --> 00:56:14,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Maybe.</font>

1519
00:56:14,840 --> 00:56:16,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How do you feel about him?</font>

1520
00:56:16,280 --> 00:56:17,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">About him?</font>

1521
00:56:17,560 --> 00:56:19,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's okay.</font>

1522
00:56:20,560 --> 00:56:21,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Xinran to Zhenyu: 2 Moonstones]
Just looking at the photos,</font>

1523
00:56:21,720 --> 00:56:22,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we don't look like a couple.</font>

1524
00:56:22,840 --> 00:56:23,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not at all.</font>

1525
00:56:23,520 --> 00:56:24,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's all right.</font>

1526
00:56:25,360 --> 00:56:27,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But why do I feel like</font>

1527
00:56:27,080 --> 00:56:30,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I always attract this kind of guy?</font>

1528
00:56:30,080 --> 00:56:31,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">With slightly longer hair,</font>

1529
00:56:31,520 --> 00:56:34,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and a slightly brooding look,</font>

1530
00:56:34,760 --> 00:56:36,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and he's into sports.</font>

1531
00:56:36,320 --> 00:56:37,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have you ever dated</font>

1532
00:56:37,720 --> 00:56:38,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">someone like that?</font>

1533
00:56:38,120 --> 00:56:39,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have.</font>

1534
00:56:40,000 --> 00:56:41,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The guys who like me</font>

1535
00:56:41,440 --> 00:56:42,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are all like that.</font>

1536
00:56:43,320 --> 00:56:44,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Almost all have medium-length hair.</font>

1537
00:56:44,560 --> 00:56:46,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's so weird. Why?</font>

1538
00:56:46,640 --> 00:56:48,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I always attract that type.</font>

1539
00:56:48,320 --> 00:56:49,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I want to try a different type.</font>

1540
00:56:51,200 --> 00:56:51,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, I mean,</font>

1541
00:56:51,560 --> 00:56:53,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Which of the guys here</font>

1542
00:56:53,840 --> 00:56:54,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">do you think you'd...</font>

1543
00:56:56,560 --> 00:56:57,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">None.</font>

1544
00:56:57,520 --> 00:56:59,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No one, honestly.</font>

1545
00:56:59,480 --> 00:57:00,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Actually, I think you and...</font>

1546
00:57:01,760 --> 00:57:03,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If I had to pick one, Wang Sheng.</font>

1547
00:57:03,540 --> 00:57:05,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Wang Sheng?]</font>

1548
00:57:05,920 --> 00:57:07,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wang Sheng is in such high demand.</font>

1549
00:57:08,840 --> 00:57:09,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is he really that popular?</font>

1550
00:57:09,800 --> 00:57:10,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Seems so.</font>

1551
00:57:12,120 --> 00:57:12,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I didn't pick up on that.</font>

1552
00:57:12,960 --> 00:57:14,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I thought he and Ren Chunxi</font>

1553
00:57:14,120 --> 00:57:15,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">seemed pretty...</font>

1554
00:57:15,560 --> 00:57:16,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They seem compatible.</font>

1555
00:57:16,400 --> 00:57:17,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah, they suit each other.</font>

1556
00:57:17,680 --> 00:57:19,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">One's got that cool attitude,</font>

1557
00:57:19,040 --> 00:57:20,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and the other looks all sweet,</font>

1558
00:57:20,560 --> 00:57:22,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but has a cheeky side deep down.</font>

1559
00:57:25,720 --> 00:57:26,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

1560
00:57:26,200 --> 00:57:28,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">From what I understood,</font>

1561
00:57:28,280 --> 00:57:29,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he said he needed some time</font>

1562
00:57:29,640 --> 00:57:30,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and all that.</font>

1563
00:57:30,560 --> 00:57:32,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But I didn't quite get it all,</font>

1564
00:57:32,120 --> 00:57:33,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">because when we were talking,</font>

1565
00:57:33,280 --> 00:57:34,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we were both a bit incoherent.</font>

1566
00:57:36,080 --> 00:57:38,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But I don't want him to think</font>

1567
00:57:38,160 --> 00:57:39,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm asking him for an answer.</font>

1568
00:57:39,760 --> 00:57:40,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm not asking him for one,</font>

1569
00:57:40,840 --> 00:57:42,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">or for anything else.</font>

1570
00:57:42,080 --> 00:57:44,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just want to spend more time with him.</font>

1571
00:57:44,280 --> 00:57:45,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Just wants to know him better]
And I feel</font>

1572
00:57:45,320 --> 00:57:47,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've made all the moves I can.</font>

1573
00:57:47,320 --> 00:57:48,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Before we gave out our Moonstones,</font>

1574
00:57:48,440 --> 00:57:49,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we had that talk.</font>

1575
00:57:49,840 --> 00:57:52,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I felt he was letting me down gently.</font>

1576
00:57:52,840 --> 00:57:54,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So I thought</font>

1577
00:57:54,240 --> 00:57:56,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I shouldn't give him all my Moonstones.</font>

1578
00:57:56,480 --> 00:57:58,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But I'm still most interested in him,</font>

1579
00:57:58,120 --> 00:57:59,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so I gave him two Moonstones.</font>

1580
00:57:59,200 --> 00:58:01,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Ren Chunxi to Wang Sheng: 2 Moonstones]</font>

1581
00:58:01,680 --> 00:58:04,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No one's picking me today.</font>

1582
00:58:04,280 --> 00:58:06,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No way!</font>

1583
00:58:06,040 --> 00:58:08,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I never make the first move in love.</font>

1584
00:58:08,540 --> 00:58:09,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Never makes the first move]</font>

1585
00:58:10,200 --> 00:58:11,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You don't want to, right?</font>

1586
00:58:11,840 --> 00:58:15,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The thought just doesn't occur to me.</font>

1587
00:58:15,000 --> 00:58:16,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When I'm</font>

1588
00:58:16,720 --> 00:58:17,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">not completely sure,</font>

1589
00:58:17,800 --> 00:58:22,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't know whether to make a move.</font>

1590
00:58:22,360 --> 00:58:24,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Hesitating]
And there's another thing.</font>

1591
00:58:24,280 --> 00:58:26,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Someone else has already decided</font>

1592
00:58:26,440 --> 00:58:28,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she wants to get to know him.</font>

1593
00:58:28,800 --> 00:58:29,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Wang Sheng]
But honestly,</font>

1594
00:58:29,320 --> 00:58:33,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">when they went on that 20-minute date,</font>

1595
00:58:34,360 --> 00:58:35,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I felt a little...</font>

1596
00:58:36,920 --> 00:58:39,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jealous, yeah.</font>

1597
00:58:42,680 --> 00:58:44,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He saved me today.</font>

1598
00:58:46,520 --> 00:58:47,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm grateful.</font>

1599
00:58:47,460 --> 00:58:48,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Claire Cai to Wang Sheng: 2 Moonstones]</font>

1600
00:58:50,040 --> 00:58:50,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's up?</font>

1601
00:58:50,560 --> 00:58:51,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come in.</font>

1602
00:58:52,760 --> 00:58:53,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's up?</font>

1603
00:58:53,440 --> 00:58:54,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just here to hang out.</font>

1604
00:58:54,280 --> 00:58:55,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come sit down.</font>

1605
00:58:56,000 --> 00:58:57,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How did it feel
when she pinned you against the wall?</font>

1606
00:58:59,000 --> 00:59:00,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I went to talk to Ren Chunxi,</font>

1607
00:59:00,840 --> 00:59:02,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and she said</font>

1608
00:59:02,680 --> 00:59:04,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she'd deliberately</font>

1609
00:59:04,520 --> 00:59:05,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">knocked those blocks over.</font>

1610
00:59:05,800 --> 00:59:08,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She said she'd been trying all day</font>

1611
00:59:08,160 --> 00:59:10,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to talk to me,</font>

1612
00:59:10,120 --> 00:59:11,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">starting conversations.</font>

1613
00:59:11,440 --> 00:59:12,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But I hadn't noticed.</font>

1614
00:59:12,880 --> 00:59:13,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's it.</font>

1615
00:59:13,680 --> 00:59:14,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Nothing else.</font>

1616
00:59:16,000 --> 00:59:18,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Four Moonstones for Ren Chunxi,</font>

1617
00:59:18,000 --> 00:59:19,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and one for Claire Cai.</font>

1618
00:59:19,680 --> 00:59:21,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As for Claire,</font>

1619
00:59:21,080 --> 00:59:21,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I gave her one Moonstone</font>

1620
00:59:21,880 --> 00:59:23,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">because</font>

1621
00:59:23,000 --> 00:59:24,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I like her personality,</font>

1622
00:59:24,440 --> 00:59:26,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Likes Claire's personality]
but we've barely spent time together,</font>

1623
00:59:26,560 --> 00:59:28,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so I could only give her one.</font>

1624
00:59:29,680 --> 00:59:31,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Wang Sheng to Claire: 1 Moonstone]
As for the four Moonstones,</font>

1625
00:59:32,040 --> 00:59:33,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ren Chunxi and I</font>

1626
00:59:33,120 --> 00:59:35,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">talked more today.</font>

1627
00:59:36,160 --> 00:59:38,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was already interested in her.</font>

1628
00:59:38,440 --> 00:59:40,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Interested in Ren Chunxi]
And from what she said,</font>

1629
00:59:40,960 --> 00:59:43,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she seems to like me a little too.</font>

1630
00:59:43,320 --> 00:59:44,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So she gets one more Moonstone.</font>

1631
00:59:44,400 --> 00:59:45,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Wang Sheng to Chunxi: 4 Moonstones]
I gave her three yesterday.</font>

1632
00:59:45,960 --> 00:59:47,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">One more today.</font>

1633
00:59:47,120 --> 00:59:48,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

1634
00:59:53,480 --> 00:59:54,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sheng.</font>

1635
00:59:56,600 --> 00:59:58,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hi. Can we talk for a minute?</font>

1636
00:59:58,120 --> 00:59:58,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sure.</font>

1637
01:00:02,040 --> 01:00:02,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

1638
01:00:04,040 --> 01:00:05,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll sit over here.</font>

1639
01:00:05,480 --> 01:00:06,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right here.</font>

1640
01:00:06,520 --> 01:00:07,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have a seat.</font>

1641
01:00:09,880 --> 01:00:11,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you feeling okay now?</font>

1642
01:00:11,440 --> 01:00:12,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm okay.</font>

1643
01:00:12,160 --> 01:00:12,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I feel much better.</font>

1644
01:00:13,640 --> 01:00:14,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just feel</font>

1645
01:00:14,360 --> 01:00:16,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've put too much pressure on you.</font>

1646
01:00:16,200 --> 01:00:17,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So I wanted to say,</font>

1647
01:00:17,040 --> 01:00:18,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">please don't feel pressured.</font>

1648
01:00:19,880 --> 01:00:20,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Pressuring me?]
I've thought about it.</font>

1649
01:00:20,960 --> 01:00:24,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If I were a guy</font>

1650
01:00:24,320 --> 01:00:25,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and you were a girl,</font>

1651
01:00:25,640 --> 01:00:27,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what I did would've been too much.</font>

1652
01:00:28,040 --> 01:00:29,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, not at all.</font>

1653
01:00:29,480 --> 01:00:30,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not at all.</font>

1654
01:00:30,560 --> 01:00:32,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">People might think</font>

1655
01:00:32,640 --> 01:00:34,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we're already paired up.</font>

1656
01:00:34,120 --> 01:00:35,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That would affect you,</font>

1657
01:00:35,440 --> 01:00:37,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">if you wanted to meet other girls.</font>

1658
01:00:37,360 --> 01:00:38,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It might stop you</font>

1659
01:00:38,320 --> 01:00:39,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">from making that choice.</font>

1660
01:00:39,800 --> 01:00:40,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And it could affect</font>

1661
01:00:40,840 --> 01:00:43,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">other girls who are interested in you</font>

1662
01:00:43,040 --> 01:00:44,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and their decisions too.</font>

1663
01:00:46,080 --> 01:00:47,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If that's the case...</font>

1664
01:00:51,760 --> 01:00:53,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can I tell you tomorrow?</font>

1665
01:00:53,700 --> 01:00:55,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Stunned]</font>

1666
01:00:56,240 --> 01:00:57,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can't process it all in one day.</font>

1667
01:00:57,160 --> 01:00:58,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sometimes I can't figure things out</font>

1668
01:00:58,520 --> 01:00:59,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">with so much happening</font>

1669
01:01:00,080 --> 01:01:00,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so fast.</font>

1670
01:01:00,960 --> 01:01:02,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He seems so clean-cut.</font>

1671
01:01:04,800 --> 01:01:06,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm not asking you to say anything now</font>

1672
01:01:06,360 --> 01:01:06,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">or come up with an answer.</font>

1673
01:01:06,960 --> 01:01:07,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't think</font>

1674
01:01:07,800 --> 01:01:09,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">there's even an answer to give.</font>

1675
01:01:09,200 --> 01:01:09,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just want you</font>

1676
01:01:09,840 --> 01:01:10,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to feel no pressure.</font>

1677
01:01:12,080 --> 01:01:13,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay, don't worry.</font>

1678
01:01:13,160 --> 01:01:14,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm fine.</font>

1679
01:01:14,640 --> 01:01:15,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

1680
01:01:17,760 --> 01:01:19,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll head back, then.</font>

1681
01:01:19,200 --> 01:01:19,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go ahead.</font>

1682
01:01:19,800 --> 01:01:20,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay, bye.</font>

1683
01:01:20,480 --> 01:01:21,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bye.</font>

1684
01:01:23,760 --> 01:01:25,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm still most interested in him.</font>

1685
01:01:25,680 --> 01:01:28,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But I felt</font>

1686
01:01:28,000 --> 01:01:29,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he was letting me down gently.</font>

1687
01:01:31,200 --> 01:01:33,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That makes me think</font>

1688
01:01:33,800 --> 01:01:36,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Holding back]
I should keep my feelings in check.</font>

1689
01:01:42,120 --> 01:01:43,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ally.</font>

1690
01:01:43,400 --> 01:01:44,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What?</font>

1691
01:01:44,080 --> 01:01:44,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go on the swing.</font>

1692
01:01:46,560 --> 01:01:48,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Finally, it's my turn on this swing.</font>

1693
01:01:49,940 --> 01:01:51,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Moving away]</font>

1694
01:01:52,220 --> 01:01:53,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Tug]</font>

1695
01:02:00,360 --> 01:02:02,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If I had feelings for another guy,</font>

1696
01:02:02,840 --> 01:02:05,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Feelings for another guy]
would you give up or keep trying?</font>

1697
01:02:08,320 --> 01:02:10,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Depends how strong they are.</font>

1698
01:02:12,040 --> 01:02:13,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah, it depends.</font>

1699
01:02:14,480 --> 01:02:16,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What about you? You're sure, right?</font>

1700
01:02:16,000 --> 01:02:16,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm quite sure.</font>

1701
01:02:17,760 --> 01:02:20,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Tianqing to Yuning: 3 Moonstones]
Tonight, I gave Yuning</font>

1702
01:02:20,520 --> 01:02:22,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">three Moonstones.</font>

1703
01:02:22,120 --> 01:02:23,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm sure about my choice.</font>

1704
01:02:23,800 --> 01:02:26,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Of course, I hope she's sure about me.</font>

1705
01:02:26,080 --> 01:02:27,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But it's still too early for that.</font>

1706
01:02:27,800 --> 01:02:30,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">For now, I know she's my choice.</font>

1707
01:02:31,400 --> 01:02:34,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I fall for someone at first sight.</font>

1708
01:02:34,160 --> 01:02:36,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So you just go for looks?</font>

1709
01:02:36,200 --> 01:02:37,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You could say that.</font>

1710
01:02:37,840 --> 01:02:40,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">For example, I can get possessive.</font>

1711
01:02:40,160 --> 01:02:41,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I haven't felt that from you.</font>

1712
01:02:43,080 --> 01:02:45,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You don't even know if I like you,</font>

1713
01:02:46,720 --> 01:02:47,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Not sure if I like you]
and you expect me to be</font>

1714
01:02:47,760 --> 01:02:49,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">possessive like we're madly in love?</font>

1715
01:02:50,240 --> 01:02:50,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fine.</font>

1716
01:02:50,520 --> 01:02:51,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So what I've learned today</font>

1717
01:02:51,520 --> 01:02:52,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is that you don't actually like me.</font>

1718
01:02:52,680 --> 01:02:54,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You just</font>

1719
01:02:54,680 --> 01:02:56,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">didn't have anyone else to like,</font>

1720
01:02:59,120 --> 01:03:00,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so you picked someone at random.</font>

1721
01:03:00,360 --> 01:03:01,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And it happened to be me.</font>

1722
01:03:01,360 --> 01:03:02,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's what you mean. I'm leaving.</font>

1723
01:03:08,960 --> 01:03:10,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's stop talking.</font>

1724
01:03:10,000 --> 01:03:10,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Silent treatment.</font>

1725
01:03:11,440 --> 01:03:12,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">For at least a day.</font>

1726
01:03:14,320 --> 01:03:17,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I do feel a bit threatened.</font>

1727
01:03:17,440 --> 01:03:19,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">After all, I wasn't</font>

1728
01:03:19,320 --> 01:03:20,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Siyang to Yuning: 3 Moonstones]
chosen without hesitation.</font>

1729
01:03:20,920 --> 01:03:22,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She didn't choose me wholeheartedly.</font>

1730
01:03:26,640 --> 01:03:27,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No talking for 24 hours.</font>

1731
01:03:27,440 --> 01:03:28,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We can talk again tomorrow.</font>

1732
01:03:34,680 --> 01:03:36,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Talking to Tianqing,</font>

1733
01:03:36,760 --> 01:03:38,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I felt we really had</font>

1734
01:03:38,720 --> 01:03:39,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Yuning to Tianqing: 3 Moonstones]
a connection.</font>

1735
01:03:39,760 --> 01:03:40,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But on my date</font>

1736
01:03:40,480 --> 01:03:42,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">with Siyang,</font>

1737
01:03:42,000 --> 01:03:42,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the atmosphere was nice.</font>

1738
01:03:43,640 --> 01:03:44,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It was romantic,</font>

1739
01:03:44,800 --> 01:03:47,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Yuning to Siyang: 2 Moonstones]
but it didn't feel honest</font>

1740
01:03:47,200 --> 01:03:48,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">or sincere.</font>

1741
01:03:48,360 --> 01:03:49,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Maybe it's just how I felt,</font>

1742
01:03:49,760 --> 01:03:51,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">or my preconceptions getting in the way.</font>

1743
01:04:06,400 --> 01:04:08,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's day two on the Island of Affection.</font>

1744
01:04:09,120 --> 01:04:11,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Still no sparks.</font>

1745
01:04:11,160 --> 01:04:13,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I seem to want to stay
in my comfort zone.</font>

1746
01:04:13,520 --> 01:04:15,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Will I change in the days ahead?</font>

1747
01:04:17,400 --> 01:04:19,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I got to know a girl yesterday,</font>

1748
01:04:19,280 --> 01:04:21,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and I was really drawn to her.</font>

1749
01:04:21,320 --> 01:04:22,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Since I've met someone I like,</font>

1750
01:04:22,240 --> 01:04:24,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I should really get to know her.</font>

1751
01:04:24,580 --> 01:04:26,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[If I like her,
I should get to know her]</font>

1752
01:04:27,400 --> 01:04:28,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm usually quite passive too.</font>

1753
01:04:28,880 --> 01:04:30,200
